  (197, 'PW03-S1-07', 1, 'AGRICULTURAL MOTOR VEHICLES.', 'យានយន្តកសិកម្ម', 'This sign is used to identify types of agricultural motor vehicles.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់សំគាល់ ប្រភេទយានយន្តកសិកម្ម ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173083/PW03-S1-07KWD_d6oo7r.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276355/PW03-S1-07_sbruaz.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276515/PW03-S1-07_kbwrys.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 13:39:23.883261', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-28 03:13:46.688395', '2026-04-28 13:39:23.883261'),
  (195, 'PW03-S1-05', 1, 'LARGE SIZED BUS.', 'រថយន្តដឹកអ្នកដំណើរធុនធំ', 'This sign is used to identify large-sized passenger buses that can carry at least 20 passengers, including the driver.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់សំគាល់ ប្រភេទរថយន្តដឹកអ្នកដំណើរធុនធំ ដែលអាចផ្ទុកអ្នកដំណើរយ៉ាងតិច ២០ នាក់ គិតទាំងអ្នកបើកបរ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173083/PW03-S1-05KWD_ygdpms.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276354/PW03-S1-05_wggvyd.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276514/PW03-S1-05_s6ntma.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 13:39:30.829855', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-28 03:11:21.672318', '2026-04-28 13:39:30.829855'),
  (194, 'PW03-S1-04', 1, 'MOTOR VEHICLES.', 'យានយន្តធុនតូច', 'This sign is used to identify small motor vehicles that can carry up to 9 people (including the driver) or cargo not exceeding 3.50 tons.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់សំគាល់ ប្រភេទយានយន្តធុនតូច ដែលអាចផ្ទុកមនុស្ស មិនលើស ៩ នាក់ គិតទាំងអ្នកបើកបរ ឬ ដឹកទំនិញ មិនលើស ៣.៥០ តោន ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173084/PW03-S1-04KWD_km1crw.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276353/PW03-S1-04_rw0far.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276513/PW03-S1-04_t5wga9.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 13:39:36.441648', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-28 03:10:14.25923', '2026-04-28 13:39:36.441648'),
