  (178, 'PW03-R3-08', 1, 'PRIORITY OVER ALL TRAFFIC FROM THE OPPOSITE DIRECTION.', 'មានសិទ្ធិអាទិភាពលើយានមកពីទិសផ្ទុយ', 'This sign indicates a narrow road ahead that only allows one lane of traffic. Drivers on the side with this sign have priority over vehicles coming from the opposite direction.
