  (250, ' PW03-P1-09', 1, 'KILOMETER POST ( FOR 10Km INTERVAL ).', 'បង្គោលគីឡូម៉ែត្រ ( សម្រាប់ចន្លោះ ១០ គ.ម )', 'This post provides distance information to major locations ahead. It is placed every 10km instead of a regular kilometer post. Bench Mark information is written on the frame or side.
