  (271, 'PW03-R1-26', 1, 'END OF NO OVERTAKING.', 'ចប់ការហាមប្រជែង', 'This sign indicates the end of the overtaking prohibition for all types of motor vehicles.', 'សញ្ញានេះ៖ ចប់ការហាមប្រជែង ចំពោះយានយន្តគ្រប់ប្រភេទ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173166/PW03-R1-26KWD_qfeftv.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276309/PW03-R1-26_yrthfv.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276484/PW03-R1-26_jxxypc.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:03:04.821102', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-30 15:40:33.878382', '2026-05-04 01:03:04.821102'),
  (206, 'PW03-S1-16', 1, 'FORWARD.', 'ទៅខាងមុខ', 'This sign is used under ''No Parking'' or ''No Stopping'' signs to identify the restricted area starting from the sign forward.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើដើម្បីពីក្រោមសញ្ញា ហាមចត ឬ ឈប់ ដើម្បីសំគាល់ទីតាំងហាមចត ចាប់ពីផ្លាកសញ្ញាទៅមុខ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173079/PW03-S1-16KWD_n60pln.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276363/PW03-S1-16_plkq5a.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276522/PW03-S1-16_qvn1g4.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:47:56.594125', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:32:09.212575', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:30:54.939141', '2026-04-28 18:47:56.594125'),
  (203, 'PW03-S1-13', 1, 'TO THE RIGHT HAND SIDE.', 'ទៅខាងស្តាំដៃ', 'This sign is used under ''No Parking'' or ''No Stopping'' signs to identify the restricted area from the sign to the right side', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើដើម្បីពីក្រោមសញ្ញា ហាមចត ឬ ឈប់ ដើម្បី សំគាល់ទីតាំងហាមចត ពីផ្លាកសញ្ញាទៅខាងស្តាំដៃ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173080/PW03-S1-13KWD_it8bjv.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276361/PW03-S1-13_aspp1l.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276520/PW03-S1-13_ehtnfz.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:51:20.923373', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:32:54.636756', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:26:25.897752', '2026-04-28 18:51:20.923373'),
  (208, 'PW03-S1-18', 1, 'BACKWARD.', 'មកខាងក្រោយ', 'This sign is used under ''No Parking'' or ''No Stopping'' signs to identify the restricted area from the sign backward.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើដើម្បីពីក្រោមសញ្ញា ហាមចត ឬ ឈប់ ដើម្បី សំគាល់ ទីតាំងហាមចត ចាប់ពីផ្លាកសញ្ញា មកខាងក្រោយ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173078/PW03-S1-18KWD_a2w6tn.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276365/PW03-S1-18_nipno8.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276523/PW03-S1-18_ffoagr.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:47:24.485559', NULL, '2026-04-28 18:22:10.546712', 'sdfsdf', 0, '2026-04-28 03:33:37.295573', '2026-04-28 18:47:24.485559'),
  (299, 'RTL-Q147', 2, 'Can you drive on or across the double solid lines dividing the road into two opposite traffic direction?', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាភ្លោះជាប់សំរាប់បែងចែកទ្រូងផ្លូវជាពីរទិសចរាចរណ៍ផ្ទុយគ្នា តើអ្នកអាចបើកបរឆ្លងកាត់ ឬជាន់ពីលើបានឬទេ ?', '
The answer is : Don’t drive on or across the markings.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ហាមបើកបរជាន់ ឬឆ្លងកាត់', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756888/RTL-Q147_johvqo.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793017/RTL-Q147-ENGLISH_wfimis.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793038/RTL-Q147-KHMER_n7k5ra.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 10:00:01.068923', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 09:46:18.912351', '2026-05-04 10:00:01.068923'),
  (209, 'PW03-S1-19', 1, 'BEWARE OF TRAIN.', 'ប្រយ័ត្ន ! រថភ្លើងឆ្លងកាត់', 'This sign is used to provide additional information about a specific type of danger, which is a railway crossing.
', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់ បញ្ជាក់បន្ថែម ពីប្រភេទគ្រោះ ថ្នាក់ ពិសេស គឺ មានរថភ្លើងឆ្លងកាត់។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173077/PW03-S1-19KWD_r0jgap.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276366/PW03-S1-19_ucnwwk.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276524/PW03-S1-19_vab0op.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-29 08:13:54.186013', NULL, NULL, 'Admin requested revision — please update and resubmit.', 0, '2026-04-28 03:34:36.215957', '2026-04-29 08:13:54.186013'),
  (205, 'PW03-S1-15', 1, 'TO THE LEFT HAND SIDE.', 'ទៅខាងឆ្វេងដៃ', 'This sign is used under ''No Parking'' or ''No Stopping'' signs to identify the restricted area from the sign to the left side.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើដើម្បីពីក្រោមសញ្ញា ហាមចត ឬ ឈប់ ដើម្បី សំគាល់ ទីតាំងហាមចត ពីផ្លាកសញ្ញា ទៅខាងឆ្វេងដៃ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173079/PW03-S1-15KWD_nhbbfu.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276362/PW03-S1-15_azevq5.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276521/PW03-S1-15_b07xou.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:49:35.017114', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:32:29.427694', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:29:35.317061', '2026-04-28 18:49:35.017114'),
  (236, 'PW03-R1-01', 1, 'NO TURN LEFT.', 'ហាមបត់ឆ្វេង', 'This sign prohibits all types of vehicles from turning left.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ បត់ឆ្វេង ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173156/PW03-R1-01KWD_txzyjc.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276289/PW03-R1-01_uv2lys.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276466/PW03-R1-01_xndavt.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:02:29.754449', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 16:14:31.376534', '2026-05-04 01:02:29.754449'),
  (211, 'PW03-S1-21', 1, 'DIRECTION OF PRIORITY ROAD.', 'បង្ហាញទិសដៅ ផ្លូវធំមានសិទ្ធិ', 'This sign is used to further clarify the right-turn direction of the priority road. The driver is currently on the priority road. The image on the sign can be reversed if the priority road turns to the left.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសម្រាប់ បញ្ជាក់បន្ថែម ពីទិសដៅបត់ស្តាំ របស់ផ្លូវធំមានសិទ្ធិ ។ អ្នកបើកបរ កំពុងស្ថិតលើ ផ្លូវធំមានសិទ្ធិ ។ រូបនៅក្នុងផ្លាកសញ្ញា អាចជាធ្លុះ បើផ្លូវមានសិទ្ធិ បត់ទៅខាងឆ្វេង ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173076/PW03-S1-21KWD_w52gq6.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777403835/PW03-S1-21_rivhdk.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276526/PW03-S1-21_fyish0.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 19:32:42.88082', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:29:17.68962', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:38:32.236354', '2026-04-28 19:32:42.88082'),
  (215, 'PW03-S1-25', 1, 'VEHICLES LOADING INFLAMMABLE GOODS.', 'យានយន្តផ្ទុកផលិតផលងាយឆេះ', 'This sign is used to identify all types of vehicles carrying flammable products.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់សំគាល់ យានយន្តគ្រប់ប្រភេទដែល មាន ផ្ទុកផលិតផលងាយឆេះ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173074/PW03-S1-25KWD_fqqyjt.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276370/PW03-S1-25_yi1pwi.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276529/PW03-S1-25_few5xr.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-29 08:13:50.74824', NULL, '2026-04-28 11:32:41.396502', 'Admin requested revision — please update and resubmit.', 0, '2026-04-28 03:42:38.231679', '2026-04-29 08:13:50.74824'),
  (212, ' PW03-S1-22', 1, 'DIRECTION OF PRIORITY ROAD.', 'បង្ហាញទិសដៅ ផ្លូវធំមានសិទ្ធិ', 'This sign is used to further clarify the direction of the priority road. The driver is currently on a minor road (no right-of-way). The image on the sign can be reversed if the priority road is located to the right and continues straight ahead.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសម្រាប់ បញ្ជាក់បន្ថែមពីទិសដៅ របស់ផ្លូវធំមានសិទ្ធិ ។ អ្នកបើកបរ កំពុងស្ថិតលើផ្លូវតូច គ្មានសិទ្ធិអាទិភាព ។ រូបនៅក្នុងផ្លាកសញ្ញា អាចជាធ្លុះ បើផ្លូវមានសិទ្ធិ ស្ថិតនៅខាងស្តាំ និង ទៅមុខត្រង់ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173075/PW03-S1-22KWD_nmgxev.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777403835/PW03-S1-22_kki3uq.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276527/PW03-S1-22_nn9tjw.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 19:32:40.144409', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:29:06.440251', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:39:25.024461', '2026-04-28 19:32:40.144409'),
  (214, 'PW03-S1-24', 1, 'TIME IDENTIFICATION.', 'បង្ហាញពេលវេលា', 'This sign is used to provide additional confirmation of time. The numbers on the sign can change according to the actual time, but the font size must be clearly readable from at least 20 meters.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់ បញ្ជាក់បន្ថែម នូវពេលវេលា ។ លេខនៅក្នុងផ្លាកសញ្ញា អាចផ្លាស់ប្តូរទៅតាម ពេល វេលាជាក់ស្តែង តែទំហំអក្សរត្រូវតែអាចមានអានបានច្បាស់ ក្នុងចម្ងាយយ៉ាងតិច ២០ម ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173075/PW03-S1-24KWD_sqqphu.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276370/PW03-S1-24_lcw22e.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276528/PW03-S1-24_grdxww.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:47:12.917642', NULL, '2026-04-28 11:32:05.942753', 'កែនឹង បន្ថែមអក្សរតាមសំឡេង', 0, '2026-04-28 03:41:28.307479', '2026-04-28 18:47:12.917642'),
  (237, 'PW03-R1-02', 1, 'NO TURN RIGHT.', 'ហាមបត់ស្តាំ', 'This sign prohibits all types of vehicles from turning right.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ បត់ស្តាំ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173178/PW03-R1-02KWD_oq1xpf.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276290/PW03-R1-02_vpgvf5.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276466/PW03-R1-02_mcuvjx.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:02:37.696072', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 16:16:41.042295', '2026-05-04 01:02:37.696072'),
  (264, 'PW03-R1-19', 1, ' NO PARKING.', 'ហាមចត', 'This sign prohibits parking for all types of vehicles, but drivers may stop briefly to pick up/drop off passengers or goods.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមចត ចំពោះយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ ប៉ុន្តែអ្នកបើកបរអាចឈប់ដាក់មនុស្ស ឬ ទំនិញឡើងចុះក្នុងរយៈពេលចាំបាច់ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173170/PW03-R1-19KWD_wnpqr8.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276303/PW03-R1-19_bhtgvu.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276479/PW03-R1-19_p6n7oq.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:03:50.122397', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-30 15:27:09.041093', '2026-05-04 01:03:50.122397'),
  (258, 'PW03-R1-13', 1, 'NO ENTRY FOR MOTORCYCLE.', 'ហាមចូលចំពោះ ទោចក្រយានយន្ត', 'This sign prohibits entry for motorcycles.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមចូលចំពោះទោចក្រយានយន្ត ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173173/PW03-R1-13KWD_erdo6h.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276298/PW03-R1-13_wp7szd.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276475/PW03-R1-13_adbspq.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:04:38.461946', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 16:46:05.045102', '2026-05-04 01:04:38.461946'),
  (257, 'PW03-R1-12', 1, 'NO ENTRY FOR BICYCLE, MOTORCYCLE AND TRICYCLE.', ' ហាមចូលចំពោះ ទោចក្រយាន ទោចក្រយានយន្ត និង ត្រីចក្រយាន', 'This sign prohibits entry for bicycles, motorcycles, and tricycles.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមចូលចំពោះ ទោចក្រយាន ទោចក្រយានយន្ត និង ត្រីចក្រយាន ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173173/PW03-R1-12KWD_nfxcil.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276298/PW03-R1-12_mybflv.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276474/PW03-R1-12_j6jc3o.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:04:43.932206', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 16:43:18.875003', '2026-05-04 01:04:43.932206'),
  (166, 'PW03-R3-01', 1, 'STOP (at Intersection).', 'ឈប់ ដើម្បិផ្តល់សិទ្ឋិអាទិភាពអោយគេ (នៅត្រង់ផ្លូវប្រសព្វ)', 'This sign indicates a loss of priority. Drivers must stop whether or not there are other vehicles crossing in front. Drivers may only proceed once the road to be crossed is clear.
', 'សញ្ញានេះ សំរាប់សំគាល់ផ្លូវបាត់សិទ្ធិ ។ អ្នកបើកបរត្រូវឈប់ទោះបីមាន ឬ គ្មានយានជំនិះផ្សេងទៀត ឆ្លងកាត់នៅខាងមុខក៏ដោយ ។ អ្នកបើកបរអាចបន្តដំណើរទៅមុខបានលុះត្រាតែផ្លូវដែលត្រូវឆ្លងកាត់នោះទំនេរ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173111/PW03-R3-01KWD_dvwtzg.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Priority Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276343/PW03-R3-01_rugdum.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276458/PW03-R3-01_a3bgri.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 6, 1, '2026-04-28 12:39:13.267485', NULL, '2026-04-28 12:05:44.869342', 'khmer title
', 0, '2026-04-27 15:12:47.40507', '2026-04-28 12:39:13.267485'),
  (180, 'PW03-R3-10', 1, 'RAILWAY CROSSING (TWO OR MORE TRACKS).', 'មានរថភ្លើងឆ្លងកាត់ (ពីរឬច្រើនខ្សែ)', 'This sign indicates two or more railway tracks crossing ahead. Drivers must be cautious and give priority to the train.
', 'សញ្ញានេះ សំរាប់សំគាល់ មានផ្លូវរថភ្លើងចំនួន ពីរ ឬ ច្រើនខ្សែ ឆ្លងកាត់នៅខាងមុខ។ អ្នកបើកបរត្រូវទុកសិទ្ធិអាទិភាព អោយរថភ្លើងឆ្លងកាត់មុន។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173107/PW03-R3-10KWD_pwnoqc.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Priority Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276350/PW03-R3-10_jguzyg.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276465/PW03-R3-10_ldzqby.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 6, 1, '2026-04-28 12:33:51.899931', NULL, '2026-04-28 12:11:33.903719', 'khmer title ', 0, '2026-04-27 16:14:26.518939', '2026-04-28 12:33:51.899931'),
  (173, 'PW03-R3-03', 1, 'GIVE WAY (at Roundabout).', 'ផ្តល់សិទ្ធិអាទិភាពអោយគេ (នៅរង្វង់មូល)', 'This sign indicates a loss of priority. Drivers must slow down or stop to give priority to vehicles already inside the roundabout.
', 'សញ្ញានេះ សំរាប់សំគាល់ផ្លូវបាត់សិទ្ធិ ។ អ្នកបើកបរត្រូវតែបន្ថយល្បឿន ឬ ឈប់ ដើម្បីផ្តល់សិទ្ធិអោយយាននៅក្នុងរង្វង់មូលទៅមុន ។
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173111/PW03-R3-03KWD_yyjpsq.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Priority Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276344/PW03-R3-03_azcfzr.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276459/PW03-R3-03_lxccd5.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 6, 1, '2026-04-28 12:38:30.083391', NULL, '2026-04-28 12:07:58.744485', 'description khmer
', 0, '2026-04-27 16:01:07.969075', '2026-04-28 12:38:30.083391'),
  (172, 'PW03-R3-02', 1, 'GIVE WAY (at Intersection).', 'ផ្តល់សិទ្ធិអាទិភាពអោយគេ (នៅត្រង់ផ្លូវប្រសព្វ)', '
This sign indicates a loss of priority. Drivers must slow down; if the road is clear, they may cross. If the road is not clear, drivers must stop and wait until the road is clear before proceeding.', '
សញ្ញានេះ សំរាប់សំគាល់ផ្លូវដាច់សិទ្ធិ ។ អ្នកបើកបរត្រូវតែបន្ថយល្បឿន បើសិនផ្លូវទំនេរ អាចឆ្លងកាត់បាន ។ បើផ្លូវមិនទំនេរ អ្នកបើកបរត្រូវឈប់រង់ចាំរហូត ដល់ផ្លូវទំនេរ ទើបអាចបន្តដំណើរបាន ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173111/PW03-R3-02KWD_xty4we.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Priority Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276344/PW03-R3-02_qcnqwt.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276459/PW03-R3-02_nswn4y.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 6, 1, '2026-04-28 12:38:55.080258', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-27 15:58:25.679187', '2026-04-28 12:38:55.080258'),
  (256, 'PW03-R1-11', 1, 'LENGTH LIMIT.', 'កំណត់បណ្តោយ', 'This sign prohibits entry for vehicles with a total length (including cargo) exceeding the limit shown on the sign.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមចូលចំពោះយានជំនិះ ដែលមានបណ្តោយ សរុប គិតទាំងបន្ទុក លើសប្រវែងកំណត់ក្នុងផ្លាកសញ្ញា ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173174/PW03-R1-11KWD_xmnen6.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276297/PW03-R1-11_bfh5ew.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276473/PW03-R1-11_rmz98o.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:04:49.131605', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 16:40:29.615147', '2026-05-04 01:04:49.131605'),
  (179, 'PW03-R3-09', 1, 'RAILWAY CROSSING (ONE TRACK).', 'មានរថភ្លើងឆ្លងកាត់ (មួយខ្សែ)', 'This sign indicates a single railway track crossing ahead. Drivers must be cautious and give priority to the train.

', 'សញ្ញានេះ សំរាប់សំគាល់ មានផ្លូវរថភ្លើងចំនួនមួយខ្សែឆ្លងកាត់នៅខាងមុខ។ អ្នកបើកបរត្រូវទុកសិទ្ធិអាទិភាព អោយរថភ្លើងឆ្លងកាត់មុន។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173108/PW03-R3-09KWD_y8xf5t.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Priority Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276349/PW03-R3-09_lenueq.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276464/PW03-R3-09_n6rnlp.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 6, 1, '2026-04-28 12:47:28.417844', NULL, '2026-04-28 12:11:14.408543', 'khmer title', 0, '2026-04-27 16:12:46.045387', '2026-04-28 12:47:28.417844'),
  (210, 'PW03-S1-20', 1, 'FACTORY''S GATE.', 'ច្រកចេញចូលរោងចក្រ', 'This sign is used to provide additional information about a specific type of danger, such as a factory entrance. The text on the sign can be changed according to the danger zone, e.g., "Port Entrance", but the font size must be clearly readable from at least 20 meters.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់បញ្ជាក់បន្ថែម ពីប្រភេទគ្រោះថ្នាក់ ពិសេស គឺ មានច្រកចេញចូលរោងចក្រ។ ពាក្យនៅក្នុងផ្ទាំងសញ្ញា អាចផ្លាស់ប្តូរទៅតាម ប្រភេទ តំបន់គ្រោះថ្នាក់ ដូចជា " ច្រកចេញចូលកំពង់ផែ " " ច្រកចេញចូលសួនកំសាន្ត " ។ល។ តែទំហំអក្សរត្រូវ តែអាចមានអានច្បាស់ ក្នុងចម្ងាយយ៉ាងតិច ២០ម ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173077/PW03-S1-20KWD_tqm0wh.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276366/PW03-S1-20_m3eniz.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276525/PW03-S1-20_paimi5.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 13:38:06.020051', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-28 03:36:01.150067', '2026-04-28 13:38:06.020051'),
  (199, 'PW03-S1-09', 1, 'VEHICLES HAVING OVER ALL WEIGHT ON AXLE EXCEEDING THE SPECIFIED WEIGHT.', 'យានមានទម្ងន់ផ្ទុកលើភ្លៅនីមួយៗ លើស ២ តោន', 'This sign is used to identify vehicles with a load weight on any axle exceeding the weight limit specified in the sign.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់សំគាល់ ប្រភេទយានដែលមាន ទម្ងន់ផ្ទុកលើភ្លៅណាមួយលើសទម្ងន់កំណត់ក្នុងសញ្ញា ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173082/PW03-S1-09KWD_l4pgyx.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276358/PW03-S1-09_anvggg.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276517/PW03-S1-09_wqpnck.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:50:39.297336', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:35:17.863652', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:19:26.425036', '2026-04-28 18:50:39.297336'),
  (200, 'PW03-S1-10', 1, 'LARGE SIZE TRUCK HAVING OVER ALL LENGTH EXCEEDING THE SPECIFIED LENGTH.', 'រថយន្តដឹកទំនិញធុនធំ ដែលមានបណ្តោយលើស ១០ម', 'This sign is used to identify large-sized trucks with a total length (including cargo) exceeding the length specified in the sign.
', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់សំគាល់ចំពោះ ប្រភេទរថយន្តដឹកទំនិញធុនធំ ដែលមានបណ្តោយសរុប គិតទាំងបន្ទុក លើស ប្រវែងកំណត់ក្នុងសញ្ញា ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173081/PW03-S1-10KWD_zrwq7u.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276358/PW03-S1-10_c3x2ow.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276518/PW03-S1-10_jfbl42.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:48:59.462198', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:33:55.33675', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:21:18.511673', '2026-04-28 18:48:59.462198'),
  (204, 'PW03-S1-14', 1, 'TO THE RIGHT AND LEFT HAND SIDE.', 'ទៅខាងស្តាំ និង ខាងឆ្វេងដៃ', 'This sign is used under ''No Parking'' or ''No Stopping'' signs to identify the restricted area from the sign to both the right and left sides.
', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើដើម្បីពីក្រោមសញ្ញា ហាមចត ឬ ឈប់ ដើម្បីសំគាល់ ទីតាំងហាមចត ពីផ្លាកសញ្ញា ទៅខាងស្តាំ និង ទៅខាងឆ្វេងដៃ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173079/PW03-S1-14KWD_zvbbhw.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276361/PW03-S1-14_mzqufj.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276521/PW03-S1-14_doygt2.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:51:17.091819', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:32:47.461086', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:27:35.844492', '2026-04-28 18:51:17.091819'),
  (213, 'PW03-S1-23', 1, 'DISTANCE IDENTIFICATION.', 'បង្ហាញចម្ងាយ', 'This sign is used to provide additional confirmation of distance. The numbers on the sign can change according to the actual distance, but the font size must be clearly readable from at least 20 meters.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសំរាប់ បញ្ជាក់បន្ថែម នូវចម្ងាយ ។ លេខនៅក្នុងផ្លាកសញ្ញា អាចផ្លាស់ប្តូរទៅតាម ចម្ងាយ ជាក់ស្តែងតែទំហំអក្សរ ត្រូវតែអាចមានអានបានច្បាស់ ក្នុង ចម្ងាយយ៉ាងតិច ២០ម ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173075/PW03-S1-23KWD_gwqjko.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276369/PW03-S1-23_zbfb7o.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276527/PW03-S1-23_u0fpiw.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:46:52.793081', NULL, '2026-04-28 11:36:47.99664', 'កែនឹង បន្ថែមអក្សរតាមសំឡេង', 0, '2026-04-28 03:40:19.118884', '2026-04-28 18:46:52.793081'),
  (207, 'PW03-S1-17', 1, 'FORWARD AND BACKWARD.', 'ទៅខាងមុខ និង មកខាងក្រោយ', 'This sign is used under ''No Parking'' or ''No Stopping'' signs to identify the restricted area both in front of and behind the sign.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើដើម្បីពីក្រោមសញ្ញា ហាមចត ឬ ឈប់ ដើម្បី សំគាល់ទីតាំងហាមចត ចាប់ពីផ្លាកសញ្ញាទៅមុខ និង មកខាងក្រោយ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173078/PW03-S1-17KWD_tp7lwl.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Supplementary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276364/PW03-S1-17_f0brjp.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276523/PW03-S1-17_pypfbp.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-28 18:47:43.923022', NULL, '2026-04-28 13:31:14.145251', 'title khmer', 0, '2026-04-28 03:32:39.101394', '2026-04-28 18:47:43.923022'),
  (300, 'RTL-Q148', 2, 'Along the road with double yellow markings, one is solid and another one is broken, dividing the road into two opposite traffic directions, which line does the vehicle closed to have priority to cross?', 'តាមបណ្ដោយផ្លូវមានគំនូសសញ្ញាភ្លោះពណ៌លឿងមួយជាប់ និងមួយដាច់ៗបែងចែកជាពីរទិសចរាចរណ៍ផ្ទុយគ្នា តើអ្នកបើកបរ នៅកៀកគំនូសសញ្ញាណាមួយអាចឆ្លងកាត់ ឬជែងបាន ?', 'The answer is : The vehicle closed to the break line has priority to cross.
', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : នៅកៀកគំនូសដាច់ៗ អាចឆ្លងកាត់ ឬជែងបាន', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756978/RTL-Q148_o5ixcx.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793057/RTL-Q148-ENGLISH_jrchch.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793075/RTL-Q148-KHMER_rxunq8.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 10:00:47.653226', NULL, '2026-05-04 09:59:46.128711', 'ugh', 0, '2026-05-04 09:48:05.044961', '2026-05-04 10:00:47.653226'),
  (221, 'PW03-M4-06', 1, 'BUS STOP MARKINGS.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញា សំរាប់រថយន្តក្រុងឈប់', 'Yellow zig-zag markings used to designate a location reserved only for buses to stop.
', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាពណ៌លឿង រាងធ្មេញរណា ប្រើដើម្បីកំណត់ទីកន្លែង សំរាប់តែរថយន្តក្រុង ឈប់។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173049/PW03-M4-06KWD_bqg7gv.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Other Road Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276273/PW03-M4-06_t4mtpo.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777441152/PW03-M4-06_uoxxoq.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-04-29 07:56:01.965677', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 07:47:29.721106', '2026-04-29 07:56:01.965677'),
  (219, 'PW03-M4-04', 1, 'CROSSWALK MARKINGS.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញា សំរាប់ថ្មើរជើងឆ្លងកាត់', 'White zebra-style blocks across the road used for pedestrian crossings. All types of vehicles are prohibited from stopping or parking on these markings.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាពណ៌ស កាត់ទទឹងទ្រូងផ្លូវ ជាដុំៗ ប្រើសម្រាប់អោយថ្មើរជើងឆ្លងកាត់។ ហាមយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ ឈប់ ឬ ចត ពីលើគំនូសសញ្ញានេះ។
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173049/PW03-M4-04KWD_d8bhgl.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Other Road Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276272/PW03-M4-04_hel64p.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777441154/PW03-M4-04_pwowbk.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-04-29 07:56:10.663008', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 07:43:57.019302', '2026-04-29 07:56:10.663008'),
  (218, 'PW03-M4-03', 1, 'DIAGONAL HATCHED MARKINGS (ON ROAD EDGE).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាភីរ៉ាមីតទ្រូងផ្លូវ (ជាប់តែមាត់ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ)', 'White diagonal hatched markings along the road edge used to define traffic boundaries, such as at the ends of parking areas. Driving over, crossing, stopping, or parking on these markings is prohibited.
', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាពណ៌ស ឆ្នូតបញ្ឆៀងតែមមាត់ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ ប្រើសម្រាប់បែងចែកទ្រូងផ្លូវចរាចរ ដូចជានៅចុងសងខាងកន្លែងចតរថយន្ត ឬ កន្លែងចាំបាច់ផ្សេងទៀត។ ហាមបើកបរជាន់ ឆ្លងកាត់ ឈប់ ឬ ចតលើគំនូសសញ្ញានេះ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173050/PW03-M4-03KWD_v5akuz.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Other Road Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276272/PW03-M4-03_xxker0.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777441154/PW03-M4-03_vkqj4s.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-04-29 07:56:14.418608', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 07:42:12.909227', '2026-04-29 07:56:14.418608'),
  (222, 'PW03-M4-07', 1, 'PARKING BAY MARKINGS (PARALLEL PARKINGS).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញា សំរាប់រថយន្តចត (ស្របតែមមាត់ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ)', 'Broken white rectangular markings with the long side parallel to the curb, used to designate spaces for parallel vehicle parking.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាដាច់ៗពណ៌ស រាងចតុកោណកែង ដែលមានជ្រុងវែង ស្របទៅនឹងតែមមាត់ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ ប្រើដើម្បីកំណត់ទីកន្លែង អោយរថយន្តចត ក្នុងចន្លោះសញ្ញានេះ។
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173048/PW03-M4-07KWD_w8vasw.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Other Road Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276275/PW03-M4-07_c6n07m.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777441153/PW03-M4-07_gumjyl.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:39:39.73793', NULL, NULL, 'Admin requested revision — please update and resubmit.', 0, '2026-04-29 07:49:33.758145', '2026-05-07 16:39:39.73793'),
  (217, 'PW03-M4-02', 1, 'CHEVRON MARKINGS (ONE-WAY ROAD).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាភីរ៉ាមីតទ្រូងផ្លូវ (ផ្លូវឯកទិស)', 'Yellow chevron (arrow-shaped) markings used to divide the road with one-way traffic. Driving over, crossing, stopping, or parking on these markings is prohibited.
', '
គំនូសសញ្ញាពណ៌លឿង រាងមុខព្រួញ លើទ្រូងផ្លូវ ប្រើសម្រាប់បែងចែកទ្រូងផ្លូវ ដែលមានចរាចរណ៍តែមួយទិស។ ហាមបើកបរជាន់ ឆ្លងកាត់ ឈប់ ឬ ចតលើគំនូសសញ្ញានេះ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173051/PW03-M4-02KWD_prxkiq.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Other Road Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276271/PW03-M4-02_ayiydu.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777441153/PW03-M4-02_korjou.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-04-29 08:03:39.537355', NULL, NULL, 'Admin requested revision — please update and resubmit.', 0, '2026-04-29 07:39:47.049405', '2026-04-29 08:03:39.537355'),
  (216, 'PW03-M4-01', 1, 'DIAGONAL HATCHED MARKINGS (TWO-WAY ROAD).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាភីរ៉ាមីតទ្រូងផ្លូវ (ផ្លូវមានចរាចរណ៍ពីរទិស)', 'Yellow diagonal hatched markings used to divide the road with two-way opposite traffic. Driving over, crossing, stopping, or parking on these markings is prohibited.
