  (224, 'PW03-M4-09', 1, 'PARKING BAY MARKINGS (ANGLED PARKINGS).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញា សំរាប់រថយន្តចត (បញ្ឆៀងតែមមាត់ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ)', 'White rectangular markings with the long side at an angle to the curb, used to designate spaces for angled vehicle parking.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញា ពណ៌ស រាងចតុកោណកែង ដែលមានជ្រុងវែងជាកំរិតបញ្ឆៀងទៅនឹងតែមមាត់ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ ប្រើដើម្បីកំណត់ទីកន្លែង អោយរថយន្តចត ក្នុងចន្លោះសញ្ញានេះ។
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173047/PW03-M4-09KWD_zucjue.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Other Road Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276276/PW03-M4-09_jjnx3d.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777441154/PW03-M4-09_kjgios.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-04-29 07:55:38.982906', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 07:53:57.754443', '2026-04-29 07:55:38.982906'),
  (223, 'PW03-M4-08', 1, 'PARKING BAY MARKINGS (VERTICAL PARKINGS).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញា សំរាប់រថយន្តចត (កែងតែមមាត់ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ)', 'White rectangular markings with the long side perpendicular to the curb, used to designate spaces for vertical (90-degree) vehicle parking.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញា ពណ៌ស រាងចតុកោណកែង ដែលមានជ្រុងវែងកែងទៅនឹងតែមមាត់ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ ប្រើដើម្បីកំណត់ទីកន្លែង អោយរថយន្តចត ក្នុងចន្លោះសញ្ញានេះ។
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173047/PW03-M4-08KWD_b89ov4.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Other Road Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276276/PW03-M4-08_ojsqki.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777441153/PW03-M4-08_tbnnfa.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-04-29 07:55:48.903061', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 07:51:46.375747', '2026-04-29 07:55:48.903061'),
  (220, 'PW03-M4-05', 1, 'ROAD HUMP MARKINGS.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញា លើទួល', 'Alternating yellow and black diagonal lines across the road used to warn drivers of the presence of a speed hump.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាពណ៌លឿងឆ្លាស់ខ្មៅ បញ្ឆៀងកាត់ទទឹងទ្រូងផ្លូវ ប្រើសម្រាប់អោយអ្នកបើកបរប្រុងប្រយ័ត្ន មានទួលនៅលើទ្រូងផ្លូវ គឺគំនូសនេះ។
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173049/PW03-M4-05KWD_xe7qyk.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Other Road Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276273/PW03-M4-05_cxarai.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777441152/PW03-M4-05_oupjxu.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-04-29 07:56:06.121839', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 07:45:42.222966', '2026-04-29 07:56:06.121839'),
  (225, 'PW03-M1-01', 1, 'STOP LINE ( SINGLE SOLID ).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាឈប់ ( ទោល )', 'A single solid white line across the road surface used to define the position where drivers must stop in front of the line at intersections controlled by traffic lights.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាទោល ជាប់ ពណ៌ស កាត់ទទឹងទ្រូងផ្លូវ ប្រើសម្រាប់ កំណត់ទីតាំងអោយអ្នកបើកបរឈប់ នៅត្រឹម មុខគំនូសនេះ នៅត្រង់ផ្លូវប្រសព្វ ដែលបញ្ជាដោយ ភ្លើងសញ្ញា ចរាចរ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173047/PW03-M1-01KWD_v0calg.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Transverse Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276252/PW03-M1-01_el4puh.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276539/PW03-M1-01_seaooi.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-29 14:00:50.191701', NULL, NULL, 'Admin requested revision — please update and resubmit.', 0, '2026-04-29 11:54:07.644348', '2026-04-29 14:00:50.191701'),
  (228, 'PW03-M1-04', 1, 'GIVE WAY LINE ( SINGLE BROKEN ).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាផ្តល់សិទ្ធិអាទិភាព ( ទោល )', 'A single broken white line across the road used to define the position where drivers must stop in front of the line at the entrance of a roundabout with ''GIVE WAY'' signs.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាទោល ដាច់ៗពណ៌ស កាត់ទទឹងទ្រូងផ្លូវ ប្រើ សម្រាប់ កំណត់ទីតាំងអោយអ្នកបើកបរឈប់ នៅត្រឹម មុខគំនូសនេះ នៅត្រង់ផ្លូវចូលរង្វង់មូល ដែលមានផ្លាក សញ្ញា ផ្តល់សិទ្ធិអាទិភាពអោយគេនៅរង្វង់មូល ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173045/PW03-M1-04KWD_g0matv.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Transverse Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276254/PW03-M1-04_iqc8f8.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276542/PW03-M1-04_ptecun.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-04-29 13:48:30.20988', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-29 11:57:59.350732', '2026-04-29 13:48:30.20988'),
  (267, 'PW03-R1-22', 1, 'NO PARKING FROM 16TH TO 31ST OF MONTH.', 'ហាមចតចាប់ពីថ្ងៃទី ១៦ ដល់ថ្ងៃទី ៣១', 'This sign prohibits parking for all types of vehicles from the 16th to the end of each month, but brief stopping for passengers or goods is allowed. The transition between the end of the month and the 1st of the next month occurs between 21:00.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមចត ចំពោះយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ ចាប់ពីថ្ងៃទី ១៦ ដល់ ថ្ងៃដាច់ខែ នៃខែនីមួយៗ ប៉ុន្តែអ្នកបើកបរអាចឈប់ដាក់មនុស្ស ឬ ទំនិញឡើងចុះ ក្នុងរយៈពេលចាំបាច់ ។ ការផ្លាស់ប្តូររវាង ថ្ងៃដាច់ខែ ទៅ ថ្ងៃទី ១ នៃខែបន្ទាប់ ប្រព្រឹត្តទៅនៅចន្លោះម៉ោង ២១:០០ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173169/PW03-R1-22KWD_uiujiu.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276306/PW03-R1-22_hmdzt0.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276482/PW03-R1-22_epum2z.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:03:32.38226', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-30 15:33:09.29399', '2026-05-04 01:03:32.38226'),
  (266, 'PW03-R1-21', 1, 'NO PARKING FROM 1ST TO 15TH OF MONTH.', 'ហាមចតចាប់ពីថ្ងៃទី ១ ដល់ថ្ងៃទី ១៥', 'This sign prohibits parking for all types of vehicles from the 1st to the 15th of each month, but brief stopping for passengers or goods is allowed. The transition between the 15th and 16th occurs between 21:00.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមចត ចំពោះយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ ចាប់ពីថ្ងៃទី ១ ដល់ ថ្ងៃទី ១៥ នៃខែនីមួយៗ ប៉ុន្តែអ្នកបើកបរអាចឈប់ដាក់មនុស្ស ឬ ទំនិញឡើងចុះ ក្នុងរយៈពេលចាំបាច់ ។ ការផ្លាស់ប្តូររវាង ថ្ងៃទី ១៥ ទៅ ថ្ងៃទី ១៦ ប្រព្រឹត្តទៅនៅម៉ោង ២១:០០ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173169/PW03-R1-21KWD_cvbxey.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276305/PW03-R1-21_dcqwcp.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276481/PW03-R1-21_vpwfbb.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:03:38.568438', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-30 15:31:12.504858', '2026-05-04 01:03:38.568438'),
  (265, ' PW03-R1-20', 1, 'NO STOPPING.', 'ហាមឈប់', 'This sign prohibits stopping for all types of vehicles.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមឈប់ ចំពោះយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173170/PW03-R1-20KWD_smst1z.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276304/PW03-R1-20_lwiujy.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276480/PW03-R1-20_g0xvgg.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:03:44.318933', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-04-30 15:28:33.393696', '2026-05-04 01:03:44.318933'),
  (241, 'PW03-R1-03', 1, 'NO U TURN.', 'ហាមបត់ត្រឡប់ក្រោយ', 'This sign prohibits all types of vehicles from making a U-turn.', 'សញ្ញានេះ ហាមយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ បត់ត្រឡប់ក្រោយ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173177/PW03-R1-03KWD_a8uxzz.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777480182/PW03-R1-03_sgqlxb.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276467/PW03-R1-03_oc2gaj.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 8, 1, '2026-05-04 01:05:22.251002', NULL, '2026-04-29 16:39:17.240421', 'en audio
', 0, '2026-04-29 16:21:28.077998', '2026-05-04 01:05:22.251002'),
  (454, 'DRV-Q038', 4, '  If the speed increases twice, how many times does the stopping distance increase?', 'បើល្បឿនកើនពីរដង តើចម្ងាយឈប់កើនឡើងប៉ុន្មានដង ?', '
The answer is Four times', 'ចម្លើយគឺ ៤ ដង', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778066215/DRV-Q038_pbeoio.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Defensive Driving', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778066192/DRV-Q038-ENGLISH_wtpfku.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778066245/DRV-Q038-KHMER_jlprnl.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 6, 1, '2026-05-06 13:46:04.135692', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-06 13:22:02.442169', '2026-05-06 13:46:04.135692'),
  (301, 'RTL-Q149', 2, 'How many groups of traffic signs are there?', 'ផ្លាកសញ្ញាចរាចរណ៍ មានប៉ុន្មានក្រុម ?', '
The answer is : There are 10 groups. Those are prohibitory signs, mandatory signs, prority signs, danger signs, temporary signs, direction indicating signs, indicating built-up area, and border signs, road name signs, service signs, and ...', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ១០ ក្រុមគឺ ផ្លាកសញ្ញាបំរាម បញ្ជា សិទ្ធិអាទិភាព គ្រោះថ្នាក់ បណ្តោះអាសន្ន បង្ហាញទិសដៅ ប្រាប់ទីប្រជុំជននិងព្រំប្រទល់តំបន់ ប្រាប់ឈ្មោះផ្លូវ ផ្លាកសញ្ញាផ្តល់ដំណឹង ផ្លាកសញ្ញា...', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756974/RTL-Q149_tpy8gb.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793054/RTL-Q149-ENGLISH_ekygcl.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793071/RTL-Q149-KHMER_fpmkhp.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 09:59:31.002262', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 09:49:51.354361', '2026-05-04 09:59:31.002262'),
  (326, 'RTL-Q174', 2, 'What shall drivers do when there is a pedestrian crossing nearby the intersection?', 'នៅពេលមានថ្មើរជើងឆ្លងកាត់នៅជិតកៀកនឹងកន្លែងផ្លូវប្រសព្វ តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្តេច ?', '
The answer is : Stop in order to get pedestrian crossed first', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ឈប់ឲ្យថ្មើរជើងកំពុងឆ្លងកាត់ ឬរៀបនឹងឆ្លងកាត់ទៅមុន', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757012/RTL-Q174_rmkamk.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792906/RTL-Q174-ENGLISH_fbgog6.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793038/RTL-Q174-KHMER_pxox6n.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:17:05.251291', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 13:34:18.055303', '2026-05-04 14:17:05.251291'),
  (324, 'RTL-Q172', 2, 'In the town or populated area, what is the maximum speed limit, in kilometers per hour, for light vehicles?', 'នៅក្នុងទីក្រុង ឬទីប្រជុំជន រថយន្តធុនតូចត្រូវបានកំរិតល្បឿនអតិបរិមាប៉ុន្មានគីឡូម៉ែត្រក្នុងមួយម៉ោង ?', '

The answer is : Not more than 40 km/h', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : មិនលើសពី ៤០ គីឡូម៉ែត្រក្នុងមួយម៉ោង', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757008/RTL-Q172_mdujzx.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792969/RTL-Q172-ENGLISH_ymwfjw.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793051/RTL-Q172-KHMER_etvalh.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:17:51.691201', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 11:24:40.108729', '2026-05-04 14:17:51.691201'),
  (323, 'RTL-Q171', 2, '  Can drivers talk on phone while driving?', 'តើអាចប្រើទូរស័ព្ទបានដែរឬទេ នៅពេលកំពុងបើកបរយានជំនិះ ?', '
The answer is : You can use if you have headphones.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : អាចប្រើបាន ប្រសិនបើមានឧបករណ៍សំឡេងភ្ជាប់', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757006/RTL-Q171_mkovet.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792921/RTL-Q171-ENGLISH_rdujbo.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793022/RTL-Q171-KHMER_gfnm4i.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:18:14.722438', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 11:22:58.394227', '2026-05-04 14:18:14.722438'),
  (322, 'RTL-Q170', 2, ' How shall no parking sign on the street have priority?', 'ផ្លាកសញ្ញាហាមចតនៅតាមដងផ្លូវ មានអាទិភាពដូចម្ដេច ?', '

The answer is : Have priority from the sign until the first cross roads behind the signs
', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : មានអាទិភាពពីផ្លាកសញ្ញា រហូតដល់ផ្លូវខ្វែងទី១ខាងក្រោយផ្លាកសញ្ញា
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757005/RTL-Q170_kzuzim.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793009/RTL-Q170-ENGLISH_smy4ng.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793031/RTL-Q170-KHMER_vtfsex.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:18:36.47314', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 11:20:52.760056', '2026-05-04 14:18:36.47314'),
  (321, 'RTL-Q169', 2, 'How much alcohol rate taken are drivers prohibited?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរយានយន្ត មានអត្រាជាតិអាល់កុលកម្រិតប៉ុន្មានត្រូវហាមឃាត់ ?', '


The answer is : Ranging from 0.25 mg per liter of the air, or 0.5g per liter of blood, and up.
', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ចាប់ពី ០,២៥ មីលីក្រាមក្នុងមួយលីត្រខ្យល់ ឬពី ០,៥០ ក្រាមក្នុងមួយលីត្រឈាមឡើងទៅ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757014/RTL-Q169_dggngr.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793025/RTL-Q169-ENGLISH_nxrzhm.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793039/RTL-Q169-KHMER_awbxoc.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:18:51.207152', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 11:18:48.536503', '2026-05-04 14:18:51.207152'),
  (320, 'RTL-Q168', 2, 'In what cubic centimeters of vehicle’s cylinder are drivers required to have a driver license?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរយានយន្តចាប់ពីទំហំស៊ីឡាំងប៉ុន្មានសង់ទីម៉ែត្រគូប ឡើងទៅ ទើបតម្រូវឲ្យមានបណ្ណបើកបរ ?', 'The answer is : 125 cubic centimeters and up.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ១២៥ សង់ទីម៉ែត្រគូប ឡើងទៅ


