  (243, 'PW03-P1-05', 1, 'OBJECT MARKER ( ON THE RIGHT ).', 'សញ្ញាបង្ហាញឧបសគ្គ នៅខាងស្តាំ', 'This marker is used to warn drivers to be cautious of obstacles on the right side, such as bridge posts or road dividers.
