  (245, 'PW03-P1-06', 1, 'OBJECT MARKER ( AT CENTER ).', 'សញ្ញាបង្ហាញឧបសគ្គ នៅលើទ្រូងផ្លូវ', 'This marker is used to warn drivers of obstacles located at the center of an intersection, such as medians or islands.
