  (294, 'PW03-W2-11', 1, 'RED FLAG.', 'ទង់ក្រហម', 'This sign is used to stop drivers in front of road personnel holding a red flag (Image A). Drivers may proceed only when the personnel lowers the flag and signals to go (Image B).

', 'សញ្ញានេះ ប្រើសម្រាប់អោយអ្នកបើកបរ ឈប់នៅមុខភ្នាក់ងារការដ្ឋាន ដែលកាន់ទង់ក្រហមសន្ធឹងកាត់ទទឹងផ្លូវថ្នល (រូប ក ) ។ អ្នកបើកបរ អាចបន្តដំណើរបាន លុះត្រាតែភ្នាក់ងារការដ្ឋាន ដាក់ទង់ក្រហមចុះ ហើយដៃឆ្វេងធ្វើសញ្ញាបញ្ជាអោយទៅ (រូប ខ ) ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173069/PW03-W2-11KWD_yhsxeu.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Temporary Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276417/PW03-W2-11_pmiqq8.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276537/PW03-W2-11_a3pr2l.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 6, 1, '2026-04-30 18:23:51.607556', NULL, '2026-04-30 17:42:39.405939', 'ាសដសាដ', 0, '2026-04-30 17:41:03.286333', '2026-04-30 18:23:51.607556'),
  (329, 'RTL-Q177', 2, 'When can drives use coating light?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរយានយន្តអាចប្រើភ្លើងកូតនៅពេលណា ?', '
The answer is : At night or the day time when we cannot see clearly or when overtaking by using alternatively with headlight.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ពេលយប់ ឬពេលថ្ងៃកាលណា (មើលមិនឃើញច្បាស់) ឬពេលសុំជែងដោយប្រើឆ្លាស់គ្នាជាមួយភ្លើងហ្វា
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757012/RTL-Q177_utmiqg.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792963/RTL-Q177-ENGLISH_pm2471.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793033/RTL-Q177-KHMER_zet9sw.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:12:44.921706', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 13:37:54.250075', '2026-05-04 14:12:44.921706'),
  (328, 'RTL-Q176', 2, 'When can drivers use headlight?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរយានយន្តអាចប្រើភ្លើងហ្វានៅពេលណា ?', '
The answer is : At night on the road without electricity or for overtaking by using alternatively with coating light.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ពេលយប់នៅលើទ្រូងផ្លូវដែលគ្មានអគ្គិសនីបំភ្លឺ ឬសុំជែងដោយប្រើឆ្លាស់គ្នាជាមួយភ្លើងកូត

', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757013/RTL-Q176_a2pi2l.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793007/RTL-Q176-ENGLISH_sbxumy.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793029/RTL-Q176-KHMER_jwyimv.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:16:25.670076', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 13:36:51.258692', '2026-05-04 14:16:25.670076'),
  (325, 'RTL-Q173', 2, 'In the center of the roads intersection, and you’re switching on the left turn light, while many vehicles lining from the opposite direction, what shall you do?', 'នៅចំណុចកណ្ដាល នៃទ្រូងផ្លូវប្រសព្វ ហើយអ្នក កំពុងធ្វើភ្លើងសញ្ញាបត់ឆ្វេង ខណៈមានរថយន្តជាច្រើនជាប់គ្នារដឹកមកពីទិសផ្ទុយគ្នា តើត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្ដេច ?', '

The answer is : Do not turn left immediately, slow down, stop your vehicle as necessary, let the vehicle from the front (opposite direction) moves ahead and then turn left carefully.
', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : មិនត្រូវបត់ឆ្វេងភ្លាមទេ ត្រូវបន្ថយល្បឿន បើចាំបាច់ឈប់ ឲ្យយានមកពីមុខទៅផុតអស់ទើប បត់ឆ្វេងដោយប្រុងប្រយ័ត្ន

', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757009/RTL-Q173_ewsjoi.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793075/RTL-Q173-ENGLISH_mhhht5.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793076/RTL-Q173-KHMER_hnljte.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:17:28.612715', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 11:31:33.148732', '2026-05-04 14:17:28.612715'),
  (308, 'RTL-Q156', 2, ' In what cases, shall drivers turn on the street light?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវបើកភ្លើងបំភ្លឺផ្លូវក្នុងករណីណាខ្លះ ?', '
The answer is : Turn on the street lingting from dusk until dawn that we can see clearly or when it is raining or fogging that we cannot see clearly.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ត្រូវបើកភ្លើងបំភ្លឺ ពីព្រលប់ដល់ពេលភ្លឺមើលឃើញច្បាស់ ឬពេលមានភ្លៀង និងចុះអ័ព្វមិនអាចមើលឃើញអ្វីច្បាស់
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757001/RTL-Q156_jlbwji.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792959/RTL-Q156-ENGLISH_t3qwt7.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793042/RTL-Q156-KHMER_hgzfw4.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:22:36.001732', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 10:27:45.971649', '2026-05-04 14:22:36.001732'),
  (458, 'DRV-Q042', 4, 'What are reasons that make front wheels slippery?', 'តើមូលហេតុអ្វី ដែលធ្វើឲ្យកង់មុខរអិល​រេ ?', '

The answer is Drive too fast on a road is not flat', '
ចម្លើយគឺ បើកបរលឿនពេកលើផ្លូវមិនរាបស្មើ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778066225/DRV-Q042_og3dwq.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Defensive Driving', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778066186/DRV-Q042-ENGLISH_e9kl4t.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778066245/DRV-Q042-KHMER_utajtl.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 6, 1, '2026-05-06 13:45:52.993031', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-06 13:34:35.291369', '2026-05-06 13:45:52.993031'),
  (338, 'RTL-Q186', 2, ' How many people can a motorcycle allow to load?', 'តើទោចក្រយានយន្តអាចផ្ទុកមនុស្សបានប៉ុន្មាននាក់ ?', '

The answer is : 2 persons and one child.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : អាចផ្ទុកមនុស្ស ២នាក់ និងបន្ថែមកុមារ ១នាក់', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756985/RTL-Q186_qa0hwg.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792936/RTL-Q186-ENGLISH_beo0we.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793003/RTL-Q186-KHMER_k4tyod.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:08:19.757719', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 13:51:10.604001', '2026-05-04 14:08:19.757719'),
  (337, 'RTL-Q185', 2, ' How many kinds of national lisences, for driving in Cambodia, are there?', 'បណ្ណបើកបរជាតិសម្រាប់បើកបរយានយន្តក្នុងព្រះរាជាណាចក្រកម្ពុជា មានប៉ុន្មានប្រភេទ?', '

The answer is : 5 kinds', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ៥ ប្រភេទ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777757002/RTL-Q185_bfnfze.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792927/RTL-Q185-ENGLISH_vp5zak.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793023/RTL-Q185-KHMER_efge4u.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:08:41.500847', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 13:49:48.558235', '2026-05-04 14:08:41.500847'),
  (336, 'RTL-Q184', 2, '  What shall you do when you meet vehicle with priority in duty using special light sign and special siren?', 'នៅពេលជួបយានមានសិទ្ធិអាទិភាពកំពុងបំពេញភារកិច្ចដោយ ប្រើភ្លើងសញ្ញាពិសេស និងសញ្ញាសូរសព្ទពិសេស តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្តេច?', '
The answer is : Slow down and move to the right side.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : បន្ថយល្បឿន អែបទៅខាងស្ដាំ ឬឈប់', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756998/RTL-Q184_zp02qk.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792976/RTL-Q184-ENGLISH_kv5pif.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793053/RTL-Q184-KHMER_yjgp9d.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:09:09.361745', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 13:48:14.048585', '2026-05-04 14:09:09.361745'),
  (335, 'RTL-Q183', 2, ' When seeing a vehicle lighting a special light of dark yellow in duty, what shall drivers do?', 'ពេលជួបយានដែលបញ្ចេញភ្លើងសញ្ញាពិសេសពណ៌លឿងទុំកំពុងបំពេញភារកិច្ច តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូធ្វើដូចម្តេច ?', '
The answer is : Pay attention in avoiding and overtaking that vehicle', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ប្រុងប្រយ័ត្នក្នុងការជៀស និងជែងយាននេះ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756966/RTL-Q183_lpw9rx.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792969/RTL-Q183-ENGLISH_bnmcus.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793039/RTL-Q183-KHMER_w7c1ls.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 7, 1, '2026-05-04 14:09:39.295998', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-04 13:46:59.11374', '2026-05-04 14:09:39.295998'),
  (334, 'RTL-Q182', 2, ' What colors are the special light signs?', 'ភ្លើងសញ្ញាពិសេសមានពណ៌អ្វីខ្លះ ?', '
