  (505, 'RTL-Q098', 2, ' Before getting in your vehicle to move backward, what shall you do?', 'មុននឹងចូលក្នុងរថយន្ត ដើម្បីបើកបរថយក្រោយ តើអ្នកត្រូវធ្វើអ្វីខ្លះ?', '
The answer is : Look behind of the vehicle carefully, make sure nothing to happen, then get into the vehicle and drive backward slowly and carefully.', '
