  (526, 'GNL-Q006', 7, ' What disease that can push to infect HIV?', 'តើជំងឺអ្វីខ្លះដែលអាចជំរុញឱ្យឆ្លងមេរោគអេដស៍?', '
The answer is Sexually transmitted disease', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ជំងឺកាមរោគ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165955/GNL-Q006_ne29va.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Road Safety', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165953/GNL-Q006-ENGLISH_hnq1pm.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165965/GNL-Q006-KHMER_aakdlb.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:39.2672', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:00:02.435085', '2026-05-07 16:40:39.2672'),
  (525, 'GNL-Q005', 7, ' Are any measures that can prevent yourself from being infected with HIV and sexually transmitted diseases?', 'តើ​មាន​វិធានការ​ណា​ខ្លះ​ដែល​អាច​ការពារ​ខ្លួន​ឯង​ពី​ការ​ឆ្លង​មេរោគ​អេដស៍ និង​ជំងឺ​កាម​រោគ?', '
The answer is Have sex with condom properly and all time', '
ចម្លើយគឺ រួមភេទជាមួយស្រោមអនាម័យឲ្យបានត្រឹមត្រូវ និងគ្រប់ពេលវេលា', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165956/GNL-Q005_vgea5w.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Road Safety', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165952/GNL-Q005-ENGLISH_zjjvsy.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165964/GNL-Q005-KHMER_ee8ame.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:42.037003', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 15:58:36.154916', '2026-05-07 16:40:42.037003'),
  (524, 'GNL-Q004', 7, ' How can you realize that someone have HIV?', 'តើ​អ្នក​អាច​ដឹង​ថា​អ្នក​មាន​មេរោគ​អេដស៍​ដោយ​របៀប​ណា?', '
The answer is By testing the blood.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ដោយការធ្វើតេស្តឈាម។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165956/GNL-Q004_b41kxu.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Road Safety', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165948/GNL-Q004-ENGLISH_ilfqhu.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165961/GNL-Q004-KHMER_wpgh4h.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:44.196966', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 15:57:00.847766', '2026-05-07 16:40:44.196966'),
  (538, 'EMG-Q006', 8, 'When the victim cannot breathe and the pulse does not work, how do you help cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR)?', 'នៅពេលដែលជនរងគ្រោះមិនអាចដកដង្ហើមបាន ហើយជីពចរមិនដំណើរការ តើអ្នកជួយសង្គ្រោះបេះដូង (CPR) យ៉ាងដូចម្តេច?', '

The answer is Massage 15 times and 2 times of mouth-to-mouth resuscitation', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ម៉ាស្សា 15 ដង និង 2 ដងនៃការសង្គ្រោះពីមាត់', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165826/EMG-Q006_nwshp3.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165817/EMG-Q006-ENGLISH_wzdl8i.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165833/EMG-Q006-KHMER_kffg6r.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:13.086296', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:21:06.183246', '2026-05-07 16:40:13.086296'),
  (537, 'EMG-Q005', 8, ' How do you realize that the victim got broken arm(s) or leg(s)?', 'តើ​អ្នក​ដឹង​ថា​ជន​រង​គ្រោះ​បាក់​ដៃ​ឬ​ជើង​ដោយ​របៀប​ណា?', '
The answer is Realizing that the victim gets a lot of hurt at the arms and legs when he/she want to move his/her them.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ដោយ​ដឹង​ថា ជន​រង​គ្រោះ​មាន​របួស​ដៃ និង​ជើង​ជា​ខ្លាំង ពេល​ចង់​រើ​ខ្លួន​។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165827/EMG-Q005_r318sk.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165818/EMG-Q005-ENGLISH_uijz5e.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165830/EMG-Q005-KHMER_ffzn3b.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:15.986691', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:19:40.37542', '2026-05-07 16:40:15.986691'),
  (536, 'EMG-Q004', 8, 'How do you realize that the victim is not breathing?', 'ធ្វើ​ម៉េច​ដឹង​ថា​ជនរងគ្រោះ​មិន​ដកដង្ហើម​?', '

The answer is The victim does not have movement up and down and no breathing through mouth and nose.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ជន​រង​គ្រោះ​មិន​មាន​ចលនា​ឡើង​ចុះ​ក្រោម និង​មិន​មាន​ដង្ហើម​តាម​មាត់ និង​ច្រមុះ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165827/EMG-Q004_f1dyaj.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165820/EMG-Q004-ENGLISH_alyvgc.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165831/EMG-Q004-KHMER_hlmyjf.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:18.307658', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:18:10.409896', '2026-05-07 16:40:18.307658'),
  (535, 'EMG-Q003', 8, ' How do you realize that the victim''s pulse does not work?', 'តើ​ធ្វើ​ដូចម្តេច​ទើប​ដឹង​ថា ជីពចរ​របស់​ជនរងគ្រោះ​មិន​ដំណើរការ?', '
The answer is By using fingers to press at the a side of the neck.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ដោយប្រើម្រាមដៃចុចនៅផ្នែកម្ខាងនៃក។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165829/EMG-Q003_ptex0q.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165817/EMG-Q003-ENGLISH_dceayx.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165829/EMG-Q003-KHMER_gna3ty.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:20.076072', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:15:54.582847', '2026-05-07 16:40:20.076072'),
  (534, 'EMG-Q002', 8, ' When there is someone has an accident, what are main points needed to check to help him or her?', 'ពេល​មាន​នរណា​ម្នាក់​ជួប​ឧបទ្ទវហេតុ តើ​មាន​ចំណុច​សំខាន់​អ្វី​ខ្លះ​ដែល​ត្រូវ​ពិនិត្យ​ដើម្បី​ជួយ​គាត់?', '
The answer is Unconsciousness, no breathing, no pulse, blooding, and bone break.', '

ចម្លើយគឺ សន្លប់, ដកដង្ហើម, ជីពចរ, ឈាម, និងបាក់ឆ្អឹង។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165830/EMG-Q002_qutfab.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165821/EMG-Q002-ENGLISH_dzhc2l.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165831/EMG-Q002-KHMER_bffdti.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:23.106309', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:14:01.351033', '2026-05-07 16:40:23.106309'),
  (533, 'EMG-Q001', 8, ' When a victim having wound with blooding, how can you help stop blooding?', 'ពេល​ជនរងគ្រោះ​មាន​របួស​ហូរ​ឈាម តើ​អ្នក​អាច​ជួយ​បញ្ឈប់​ការ​ហូរ​ឈាម​ដោយ​របៀប​ណា​?', '
The answer is Use good cloth or bandage to tight around the wound, fasten a bit tightly.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ប្រើក្រណាត់ ឬបង់រុំល្អដើម្បីរឹតបន្តឹងជុំវិញមុខរបួស ចងឱ្យជិតបន្តិច។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165821/EMG-Q001_mhirgj.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165819/EMG-Q001-ENGLISH_bjsogs.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165832/EMG-Q001-KHMER_w8bx9n.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:25.48344', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:11:59.743006', '2026-05-07 16:40:25.48344'),
  (547, 'EMG-Q015', 8, 'If victim no breathing and the pulse no working, how can you help?', 'ប្រសិនបើជនរងគ្រោះមិនដកដង្ហើម ហើយជីពចរមិនដំណើរការ តើអ្នកអាចជួយយ៉ាងដូចម្តេច?', '


The answer is Blow the air in through his or her mouth and bring the two hands press his or her chest.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ ផ្លុំខ្យល់ចូលតាមមាត់របស់គាត់ ហើយយកដៃទាំងពីរចុចទ្រូងរបស់គាត់។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165828/EMG-Q015_jqvvpe.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165817/EMG-Q015-ENGLISH_ohm1yf.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165832/EMG-Q015-KHMER_kzbc8h.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:39:51.138572', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:34:44.293188', '2026-05-07 16:39:51.138572'),
  (546, 'EMG-Q014', 8, ' How many minutes of no breathing does it cause the victim dead?', 'អត់​ដង្ហើម​ប៉ុន្មាន​នាទី​ទើប​ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ជន​រង​គ្រោះ​ស្លាប់?', '
The answer is From 5 minutes and up.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ចាប់ពី 5 នាទីឡើងទៅ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165830/EMG-Q014_o6j2mi.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165819/EMG-Q014-ENGLISH_zpbwdv.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165832/EMG-Q014-KHMER_vucpj9.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:39:55.788666', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:33:14.362041', '2026-05-07 16:39:55.788666'),
  (544, 'EMG-Q012', 8, ' Can you touch an accident victim?', 'តើអ្នកអាចប៉ះជនរងគ្រោះដោយគ្រោះថ្នាក់បានទេ?', '
The answer is Yes, by helping through First Aids.', '

ចម្លើយគឺ បាទ ដោយការជួយតាមរយៈ First Aids។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165828/EMG-Q012_uwhsuc.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165820/EMG-Q012-ENGLISH_gufb7t.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165833/EMG-Q012-KHMER_qeqrwc.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:39:59.679994', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:29:38.804117', '2026-05-07 16:39:59.679994'),
  (543, 'EMG-Q011', 8, ' When victim not breathing and pulse not working and you are alone, how shall you do PCR and blow the air in?', 'នៅពេលដែលជនរងគ្រោះមិនដកដង្ហើម ហើយជីពចរមិនដំណើរការ ហើយអ្នកនៅម្នាក់ឯង តើអ្នកត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្តេចដើម្បី PCR និងផ្លុំខ្យល់ចូល?', '
The answer is Press 15 times and blow 2 times', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ចុច 15 ដងហើយផ្លុំ 2 ដង', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165822/EMG-Q011_e1fhbt.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165819/EMG-Q011-ENGLISH_dwsvby.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165830/EMG-Q011-KHMER_wvnbih.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:02.885563', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:28:12.422573', '2026-05-07 16:40:02.885563'),
  (542, 'EMG-Q010', 8, ' If the victim is not breathing, how many times per minutes shall you blow the air in through his or her mouth?', 'ប្រសិនបើជនរងគ្រោះមិនដកដង្ហើម តើអ្នកត្រូវផ្លុំខ្យល់ចូលតាមមាត់របស់គាត់ប៉ុន្មានដងក្នុងមួយនាទី?', '
The answer is About 15 times per minute', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ប្រហែល 15 ដងក្នុងមួយនាទី', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165823/EMG-Q010_lu2ntg.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165817/EMG-Q010-ENGLISH_czwyla.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165831/EMG-Q010-KHMER_vijski.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:04.841084', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:26:52.632539', '2026-05-07 16:40:04.841084'),
  (551, 'RTL-Q004', 2, '  How far in meters, at least, do motorcycle drivers give a turn sign before turning left or right from the turn road or the intersection?', 'នៅពេលបត់ឆ្វេង ឬបត់ស្ដាំ តើអ្នកបើកបរទោចក្រយានយន្ដឱ្យសញ្ញាបត់ឆ្វេង ឬស្ដាំជាដំណឹងចម្ងាយយ៉ាងតិច ប៉ុន្មានម៉ែត្រពីផ្លូវបត់ ឬផ្លូវប្រសព្វ ?', '
The answer is : At least 20m', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : យ៉ាងតិច ២០ ម៉ែត្រ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756945/RTL-Q004_zzwe1h.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793029/RTL-Q004-ENGLISH_bgrsle.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793055/RTL-Q004-KHMER_nlpxk4.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:53:15.212474', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:21:28.66121', '2026-05-08 13:53:15.212474'),
  (550, 'RTL-Q003', 2, '  What is the maximum speed limit (km/h) of bicycle in built-up area?', 'ក្នុងទីប្រជុំជន តើការកំណត់ល្បឿនអតិបរមា សម្រាប់ទោចក្រយានយន្ដប៉ុន្មាន ?', '
The answer is : 30km/h', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ៣០ គ.ម ក្នុងមួយម៉ោង', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756923/RTL-Q003_siu2xa.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792908/RTL-Q003-ENGLISH_wmkqtg.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793030/RTL-Q003-KHMER_n12l3j.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:53:17.543753', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:20:04.091822', '2026-05-08 13:53:17.543753'),
  (545, 'EMG-Q013', 8, ' Realizing the victim got broken arm, how shall you do?', 'ដឹង​ថា​ជន​រង​គ្រោះ​បាក់​ដៃ​ធ្វើ​ម៉េច?', '
The answer is Leave the broken arm with no moving then use metal or wooden board to splint the arm, and then tie with cloth or scaft at the neck to suport the broken arm.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ទុក​ដៃ​ដែល​បាក់​នោះ​ដោយ​មិន​បាច់​ធ្វើ​ចលនា បន្ទាប់​មក​ប្រើ​ដែក ឬ​ក្តារ​ឈើ​ដើម្បី​ពុះ​ដៃ រួច​ចង​នឹង​ក្រណាត់ ឬ​ស្នាម​នៅ​ក ដើម្បី​ទ្រទ្រង់​ដៃ​ដែល​បាក់។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165826/EMG-Q013_lj5qz0.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165818/EMG-Q013-ENGLISH_ascweb.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165832/EMG-Q013-KHMER_oys0i7.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:39:57.698029', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:31:04.22627', '2026-05-07 16:39:57.698029'),
  (541, 'EMG-Q009', 8, '  How many minutes can you help victim with no breathing?', 'តើអ្នកអាចជួយជនរងគ្រោះដោយដកដង្ហើមបានប៉ុន្មាននាទី?', '
The answer is 2 to 3 minutes', 'ចម្លើយគឺ 2 ទៅ 3 នាទី។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165827/EMG-Q009_vapoir.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165817/EMG-Q009-ENGLISH_ypujpm.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165831/EMG-Q009-KHMER_uzjlan.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:07.310341', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:25:21.320641', '2026-05-07 16:40:07.310341'),
  (540, 'EMG-Q008', 8, ' If the victim is not breathing, how can you help him or her?', 'បើជនរងគ្រោះមិនដកដង្ហើម តើអ្នកអាចជួយគាត់ដោយរបៀបណា?', '
The answer is Do the CPR by blowing the air in through the victim''s mouth and press his or her chest by two hands.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ធ្វើ CPR ដោយផ្លុំខ្យល់ចូលតាមមាត់ជនរងគ្រោះ ហើយចុចទ្រូងដោយដៃពីរ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165826/EMG-Q008_je6ict.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165819/EMG-Q008-ENGLISH_hgxcmc.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165830/EMG-Q008-KHMER_gb3qdd.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:09.147349', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:23:53.475347', '2026-05-07 16:40:09.147349'),
  (539, 'EMG-Q007', 8, ' If victim is unconscious. How can you help if you touch his/her shoulders but he/she is till unconscious?', 'ប្រសិនបើជនរងគ្រោះសន្លប់។ តើ​អ្នក​អាច​ជួយ​បាន​យ៉ាង​ដូច​ម្ដេច​ប្រសិន​បើ​អ្នក​ប៉ះ​ស្មា​គាត់ ប៉ុន្តែ​គាត់​រហូត​ដល់​សន្លប់?', '
The answer is Let him/her lie down or let him/her incline to one side so that the air can easily get through', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ឱ្យ​គាត់​ដេក ឬ​ឱ្យ​គាត់​ផ្អៀង​ទៅ​ម្ខាង ដើម្បី​ឱ្យ​ខ្យល់​ចូល​បាន​យ៉ាង​ងាយ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165821/EMG-Q007_xkl3r1.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'First Aid', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165821/EMG-Q007-ENGLISH_ihmjcz.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165832/EMG-Q007-KHMER_cfwsy7.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:11.335677', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:22:30.529001', '2026-05-07 16:40:11.335677'),
  (529, 'GNL-Q009', 7, ' Realizing that you have HIV, what practice shall you choose?', 'ដឹង​ថា​អ្នក​មាន​មេរោគ​អេដស៍ តើ​អ្នក​ត្រូវ​ជ្រើសរើស​ទម្លាប់​មួយ​ណា?', '
The answer is Have sex using condom properly and all time.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ រួមភេទដោយប្រើស្រោមអនាម័យឲ្យបានត្រឹមត្រូវ និងគ្រប់ពេលវេលា។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165959/GNL-Q009_v3xt2r.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Road Safety', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165952/GNL-Q009-ENGLISH_cuztkm.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165960/GNL-Q009-KHMER_t0u0bh.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:34.073749', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 16:04:32.018774', '2026-05-07 16:40:34.073749'),
  (523, 'GNL-Q003', 7, ' Up to now, is there a medicine that can cure the HIV/AIDS?', 'មក​ដល់​ពេល​នេះ តើ​មាន​ថ្នាំ​ណា​អាច​ព្យាបាល​មេរោគ​អេដស៍​បាន​ទេ?', '
The answer is No, there isn''t.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ ទេ វាមិនមានទេ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778165958/GNL-Q003_apshtd.png', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Road Safety', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165954/GNL-Q003-ENGLISH_ljb7t5.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778165964/GNL-Q003-KHMER_goon8q.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:40:46.100337', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 15:55:08.239818', '2026-05-07 16:40:46.100337'),
  (513, 'LDG-Q007', 6, ' Loading goods, how high of goods from the earth is allowed?', 'ការ​ផ្ទុក​ទំនិញ តើ​ទំនិញ​ពី​ផែនដី​ត្រូវ​បាន​អនុញ្ញាត​ឱ្យ​ខ្ពស់​ប៉ុណ្ណា?', '
The answer is Not more than 4.20m', '
ចម្លើយគឺ មិនលើសពី 4.20 ម។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1778166068/LDG-Q007_asa8rx.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Cargo Securing', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778166006/LDG-Q007-ENGLISH_irk6mh.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778166075/LDG-Q007-KHMER_lprtom.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-07 16:41:06.258834', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-07 15:39:55.234518', '2026-05-07 16:41:06.258834'),
  (558, 'RTL-Q011', 2, '  The definition of ’lane’?', 'និយមន័យ «គន្លងផ្លូវ» ?', '

The answer is : A part of the road barrier by markings or materials separating road along the road with leaving sufficient width for one line traffic', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ចំណែកមួយនៃទ្រូងផ្លូវ ខណ្ឌដោយគំនូសឬបរិក្ខារបែងចំណែកផ្លូវតាមបណ្ដោយទ្រូងផ្លូវ មានទទឹងគ្រប់គ្រាន់អាចធ្វើចរាចរណ៍បានមួយជួរ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756952/RTL-Q011_kgmyyn.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793033/RTL-Q011-ENGLISH_z6opl7.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793038/RTL-Q011-KHMER_bsolu2.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:53:00.494029', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:32:04.683266', '2026-05-08 13:53:00.494029'),
  (557, 'RTL-Q010', 2, '   In accordance with law, at what weight of trail loaded can a motorcycle carry?', 'តើច្បាប់អនុញ្ញាតឱ្យសណ្ដោងរ៉ឺម៉ក ផ្ទុកទំនិញបានប៉ុន្នានគីឡូក្រាម ?', '
The answer is : Not more than 300kg', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : មិនឱ្យ លើសពី ៣០០ គីឡូក្រាម', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756965/RTL-Q010_kalagv.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792952/RTL-Q010-ENGLISH_e53em0.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793002/RTL-Q010-KHMER_hepczp.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:53:02.952332', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:30:38.358538', '2026-05-08 13:53:02.952332'),
  (556, 'RTL-Q009', 2, '   Avoiding each other on a steep, narrow road, which vehicle has priority to go first?', 'ពេលជៀសគ្នា នៅលើផ្លូវចោតហើយចង្អៀត តើយានជំនិះណាមួយមានសិទ្ធិទៅមុន ?', '
The answer is : The one is moving up.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ទុកឱ្យ យានជំនិះ ឡើងចំណោតទៅមុន', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756980/RTL-Q009_cpanht.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792946/RTL-Q009-ENGLISH_qpw25m.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793021/RTL-Q009-KHMER_z3h9yp.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:53:04.691246', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:29:04.024247', '2026-05-08 13:53:04.691246'),
  (555, 'RTL-Q008', 2, '   In the built-up area, you are driving at the speed of 30km/h, how long of a distance limit for motorcycles shall you leave?', 'នៅក្នុងទីប្រជុំជន អ្នកបើកបរក្នុងល្បឿន ៣០ គ.ម ក្នុងមួយម៉ោង តើអ្នកត្រូវរក្សាទុកចន្លោះសុវត្ថិភាពប៉ុន្មានម៉ែត្រ ?', '
The answer is : At least 9m', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : យ៉ាងតិច ៩ ម៉ែត្រ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756922/RTL-Q008_bsblyc.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793025/RTL-Q008-ENGLISH_bguqfy.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793030/RTL-Q008-KHMER_cmebry.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:53:06.395531', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:27:48.576335', '2026-05-08 13:53:06.395531'),
  (554, 'RTL-Q007', 2, '  What light do motorists turn on in the daytime with heavy rain or fog?', 'នៅពេលថ្ងៃ ដែលមានភ្លៀងធ្លាក់ខ្លាំង ឬ ចុះអ័ព្វ តើអ្នកបើកបរ ត្រូវបើកភ្លើងអ្វី ?', '
The answer is : Coating light', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ត្រូវបើកភ្លើង កូត', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756934/RTL-Q007_jh4sxs.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792944/RTL-Q007-ENGLISH_r7e95f.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793006/RTL-Q007-KHMER_r5qu6i.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:53:08.693588', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:26:00.701775', '2026-05-08 13:53:08.693588'),
  (552, 'RTL-Q005', 2, '  Outside the built-up area, a division of the road is used by motorcycles and vehicles together, which side shall drivers overtake the vehicles?', 'នៅក្រៅទីប្រជុំជន ចំណែកទ្រូងផ្លូវសម្រាប់ និងប្រើប្រាស់តែមួយរួមគ្នា តើត្រូវជែងនៅខាងណា ?', '
The answer is : Overtake on the left side', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ត្រូវជែង នៅខាងឆ្វេងដៃ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756948/RTL-Q005_troen8.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792969/RTL-Q005-ENGLISH_bmmgzy.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793030/RTL-Q005-KHMER_aqvxtu.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:53:12.958128', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:23:19.543518', '2026-05-08 13:53:12.958128'),
  (568, 'RTL-Q021', 2, '  How many persons can a motorcycle accommodate, due to the law?', 'តើទោចក្រយានយន្ដអនុញ្ញាតឱ្យផ្ទុកមនុស្សចំនួនប៉ុន្មាននាក់ ?', '
The answer is : Two adults and one child', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : អនុញ្ញាតឱ្យផ្ទុកមនុស្សពេញវ័យបាន២នាក់ និងអាចបន្ថែមបានកុមារម្នាក់', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756977/RTL-Q021_o9h1kr.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792923/RTL-Q021-ENGLISH_fklo5z.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793043/RTL-Q021-KHMER_vilgs2.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:34.852763', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:45:49.527434', '2026-05-08 13:52:34.852763'),
  (567, 'RTL-Q020', 2, '  What shall you do when you see pedestrians crossing the road without zebra?', 'នៅពេលអ្នកបើកបរទោចក្រយានយន្ដ និងត្រីចក្រយានយន្ដ ជួបអ្នកថ្មើរជើងដែលកំពុងឆ្លងកាត់ទ្រូងផ្លូវ គ្មានគំនូសសញ្ញាសម្រាប់ថ្មើរជើងឆ្លងកាត់ តើអ្នកត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្ដេចខ្លះ?', '
The answer is : Do not distrupt the pedestrians', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ហាមធ្វើឱ្យអាក់ខាន ឬរាំងស្ទះដល់ថ្មើរជើងធ្វើដំណើរ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756985/RTL-Q020_fk96jk.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792980/RTL-Q020-ENGLISH_t7ue0y.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793069/RTL-Q020-KHMER_qphwl8.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:40.763859', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:44:30.307734', '2026-05-08 13:52:40.763859'),
  (566, 'RTL-Q019', 2, '  On the zebra walking line, can drivers stop on it?', 'នៅលើគំនូសថ្មើរជើងឆ្លងកាត់ តើអ្នកបើកបរអាចឈប់បានឬទេ?', '
The answer is : No stopping', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ហាមឈប់', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756901/RTL-Q019_jnyg4t.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792937/RTL-Q019-ENGLISH_wj08rj.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793022/RTL-Q019-KHMER_mqt4at.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:42.892369', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:43:08.739407', '2026-05-08 13:52:42.892369'),
  (565, 'RTL-Q018', 2, '  When seeing a ’no-parking sign’, can drivers stop?', 'ពេលជួបប្រទះផ្លាកសញ្ញាហាមចត តើអ្នកបើកបរអាចឈប់បានឬទេ?', '
The answer is : Can', '
