  (564, 'RTL-Q017', 2, '  Can motorists drive up with a breast travelling on the same lane?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរទោចក្រយានយន្ដ អាចបើកបរទន្ទឹមគ្នានៅលើគន្លងផ្លូវតែមួយ បានឬទេ?', '
The answer is : No driving up along side.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ហាមបើកបរទន្ទឹមគ្នា', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756972/RTL-Q017_yuqtb3.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792955/RTL-Q017-ENGLISH_w6sniw.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793010/RTL-Q017-KHMER_mmg9x6.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:47.000966', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:40:29.590983', '2026-05-08 13:52:47.000966'),
  (563, 'RTL-Q016', 2, '  What is the road user?', 'ដូចម្ដេច ដែលហៅថា អ្នកប្រើប្រាស់ផ្លូវ?', '
The answer is : The drivers of vehicles and pedestrians who travel on the road.', '
