  (561, 'RTL-Q014', 2, '  How many people can a trailer with two seats opposite each other accommodates in accordance with the law?', 'តើច្បាប់អនុញ្ញាតឱ្យរ៉ឺម៉កដែលមានពូកទទឹងពីរទល់មុខគ្នា ផ្ទុកមនុស្សប៉ុន្មាននាក់ ?', '
The answer is : Not more than 4 persons', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : មិនឱ្យលើសពី ៤ នាក់', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756882/RTL-Q014_uhnxrt.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792989/RTL-Q014-ENGLISH_kkywjo.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793056/RTL-Q014-KHMER_vi5toq.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:53.583783', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:36:08.279216', '2026-05-08 13:52:53.583783'),
  (577, 'RTL-Q030', 2, ' Can you call or answer the phone while driving a motorcycle if you do not have any earphones?', 'នៅពេលអ្នកកំពុងបើកបរទោចក្រយានយន្ដ អាចនិយាយទូរស័ព្ទបានឬទេប្រសិនបើគ្មានឧបករណ៏ទំនាក់ទំនង?', '
