', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756942/RTL-Q028_zbuk9k.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792931/RTL-Q028-ENGLISH_ca68to.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793019/RTL-Q028-KHMER_hxksoj.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:19.904267', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 13:16:00.486153', '2026-05-08 13:52:19.904267'),
  (574, 'RTL-Q027', 2, ' Can all kinds of vehicles stop or park on the zebra?', 'តើយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ អាចឈប់ ឬចតលើគំនូសសញ្ញាសម្រាប់ថ្មើរជើងឆ្លងកាត់បាន ឬទេ ?', '
The answer is : Don’t park or stop on the zebra.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ហាមឈប់ ឬចតយានជំនិះពីលើជាដាច់ខាត
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756984/RTL-Q027_yqjnjt.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792946/RTL-Q027-ENGLISH_xheygf.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793039/RTL-Q027-KHMER_nu2ajp.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:21.632769', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 13:12:28.967904', '2026-05-08 13:52:21.632769'),
  (573, 'RTL-Q026', 2, '  At which side do all drivers for all kinds of vehicles avoid each other?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ ត្រូវជៀសគ្នាទៅខាងណា ?', '
The answer is : On the right hand side', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ត្រូវជៀសគ្នា នៅខាងស្ដាំរបស់ខ្លួន', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756982/RTL-Q026_yijbl5.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792992/RTL-Q026-ENGLISH_vtshag.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793006/RTL-Q026-KHMER_j4lqid.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:23.402515', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 13:08:57.508457', '2026-05-08 13:52:23.402515'),
  (572, 'RTL-Q025', 2, '  When is horn allowed to honk?', 'តើការប្រើប្រាស់ ស៊ីផ្លេ ត្រូវបានអនុញ្ញាត នៅពេលណាខ្លះ ?', '

The answer is : At the daytime', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : ពេលថ្ងៃ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756936/RTL-Q025_ta0pcm.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792942/RTL-Q025-ENGLISH_h7z0le.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792969/RTL-Q025-KHMER_whjfkd.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:25.815727', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 13:07:20.056964', '2026-05-08 13:52:25.815727'),
  (571, 'RTL-Q024', 2, '  In the city or the built-up area, road with two opposite traffic directions, two lanes for each side, which lane do motorists drive on?', 'នៅក្នុងទីក្រុងឬប្រជុំជន មានបែងចែកទ្រូងផ្លូវជា២ទិសចរាចរណ៍ ហើយទិសម្ខាងមាន២គន្លងផ្លូវ តើអ្នកបើកបរទោចក្រយានយន្ដ ត្រូវបើកបរនៅគន្លងផ្លូវណា ?', '
The answer is : On the right lane', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : នៅគន្លងផ្លូវខាងស្ដាំ
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756936/RTL-Q024_stsmjx.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792922/RTL-Q024-ENGLISH_nzau1c.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793050/RTL-Q024-KHMER_jckr2d.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:28.667236', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 13:04:57.185291', '2026-05-08 13:52:28.667236'),
  (570, 'RTL-Q023', 2, ' On a road with or without road-divided markings into two opposite traffic directions, how shall motorists drive?', 'នៅលើទ្រូងផ្លូវដែលគ្មាន ឬមានគំនូសបែងចែកទ្រូងផ្លូវជាពីរទិសផ្ទុយគ្នា តើអ្នកបើកបរទោចក្រយានយន្ដត្រូវបើកដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : Drive alongside the right closed to the sidewalk.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : បើកបរអែបស្ដាំកៀកនឹងចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756907/RTL-Q023_kleifk.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793035/RTL-Q023-ENGLISH_tgyav9.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793045/RTL-Q023-KHMER_uzut6y.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:30.465097', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:49:25.889104', '2026-05-08 13:52:30.465097'),
  (584, 'RTL-Q037', 2, '  How far from the intersections shall you stop to drop and pick up passengers on the road in built-up area?', 'នៅលើមហាវិថីក្នុងទីប្រជុំជន តើយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ ត្រូវឈប់ដាក់មនុស្សឡើង ឬចុះ នៅចម្ងាយប៉ុន្មានម៉ែត្រ ពីផ្លូវប្រសព្វ?', '
The answer is : At least 10m', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : យ៉ាងតិច ១០ ម៉ែត្រ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756976/RTL-Q037_k0im2f.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792947/RTL-Q037-ENGLISH_ovcdme.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793022/RTL-Q037-KHMER_ygdcx9.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:02.950446', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 13:30:42.830993', '2026-05-08 13:52:02.950446'),
  (583, 'RTL-Q036', 2, '  Can motorists or tricycle drivers overtake on the right?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរទោចក្រយានយន្ដ ឬត្រីចក្រយានយន្ដ អាចជែងខាងស្ដាំ បានឬទេ?', '
The answer is : Can overtake unless vehicle you are overtaking has been redirected the sign to the left and stop signs, or be ready to turn left', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : បាន! លើកលែងតែយានដែលអ្នកត្រូវជែងនោះ កំពុងធ្វើសញ្ញាប្ដូរទិសខាងឆ្វេង ហើយឈប់ ឬត្រៀមបត់ឆ្វេង', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756977/RTL-Q036_npekab.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793044/RTL-Q036-ENGLISH_b55lj6.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793062/RTL-Q036-KHMER_jqhjj1.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:05.346364', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 13:29:07.785922', '2026-05-08 13:52:05.346364'),
  (582, 'RTL-Q035', 2, ' According to the road traffic law, at what rate of alcohol in milligram per liter of air is forbidden?', 'តើច្បាប់ចរាចរណ៍ផ្លូវគោក ហាមពិសាជាតិស្រវឹងដែលមានអត្រាជាតិអាកុលចាប់ពី ប៉ុន្មានមីលីក្រាម ក្នុងមួយលីត្រខ្យល់?', '
The answer is : From 0.25mg per liter of air', '
