  (569, 'RTL-Q022', 2, '   How many kinds of traffic signs are there? What are they?', 'តើសញ្ញាចរាចរណ៍ មានប៉ុន្មានប្រភេទ អ្វីខ្លះ ?', '
The answer is : There are 4 kinds. There are traffic lights, traffic signs, traffic markings, and direction signs from traffic plice officers.', 'ចម្លើយគឺ : មានបួនប្រភេទ គឺ ភ្លើងសញ្ញាចរាចរណ៍-ផ្លាកសញ្ញាចរាចរណ៍-គំនូសសញ្ញាចរាចរណ៍ និងសញ្ញាបញ្ជារបស់ភ្នាក់ងារនគរបាលចរាចរណ៍', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756909/RTL-Q022_ajp4uu.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792993/RTL-Q022-ENGLISH_zzhurp.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793058/RTL-Q022-KHMER_ggko7h.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:32.788526', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:47:38.248555', '2026-05-08 13:52:32.788526'),
  (560, 'RTL-Q013', 2, '  What space from the one overtaken shall drivers leave when overtaking?', 'នៅពេលជែង តើត្រូវទុកចន្លោះគម្លាតប៉ុន្មានម៉ែត្រពីយានដែលអ្នកត្រូវជែង ?', '
The answer is : At least 1.00m', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : យ៉ាងតិច ១ ម៉ែត្រ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756975/RTL-Q013_slkecf.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792922/RTL-Q013-ENGLISH_xl7xvk.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793005/RTL-Q013-KHMER_jv0hvc.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 13:52:55.551728', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 09:34:43.99311', '2026-05-08 13:52:55.551728'),
  (559, 'RTL-Q012', 2, '  One is driving from the trail or red road, another one is driving on National Road. which one is more prioritized to go first?', 'អ្នកបើកបរចេញពីផ្លូវលំ ឬដី និងអ្នកបើកបរលើផ្លូវជាតិ តើអ្នកបើកបរណាមានសិទ្ធិទៅមុន ?', '
The answer is : The one is on the Natinal Road.', '
