  (593, 'RTL-Q046', 2, 'Close to the main road, small or narrow,path, what does the driver have to do?', 'ជិតដល់ផ្លូវធំរួមតូច ឬចង្អៀត តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្ដេច ?', '



The answer is : Slow down or stop, let vehicles arriving narrow road move ahead.', '
