The answer is : No parking or stopping.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ហាមឈប់ ឬចត', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756928/RTL-Q062_tlpjgy.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792941/RTL-Q062-ENGLISH_onay9o.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792997/RTL-Q062-KHMER_u7uwnd.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:26.203741', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 15:14:59.391884', '2026-05-08 17:00:26.203741'),
  (608, 'RTL-Q061', 2, '  For what kind of vehicles is limited the maximum speed limit of 80 km/h outside built-up area?', 'តើការកំណត់ល្បឿនបើកបរអតិបរមានៅក្រៅទីប្រជុំជន ៨០ គីឡូម៉ែត្រក្នុងមួយម៉ោង សម្រាប់ប្រភេទ​យានយន្តអ្វីខ្លះ ?', '
The answer is : Light-duty vehicles and passenger vehicles', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : សម្រាប់ធុនស្រាល និងដឹកអ្នកដំណើរ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756975/RTL-Q061_tzaaqa.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793018/RTL-Q061-ENGLISH_yytqbj.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793023/RTL-Q061-KHMER_q2edzi.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:27.986764', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 15:13:28.069579', '2026-05-08 17:00:27.986764'),
  (607, 'RTL-Q060', 2, '  The maximum speed limit, km/h, outside built-up area for motorcycle with cylinder of more than 125 cubic centimeters .?', 'ល្បឿនបើកបរអតិបរមានៅក្រៅទីប្រជុំជន សម្រាប់ទោចក្រយានយន្ត ទំហំស៊ីឡាំងលើសពី ១២៥ សង់ទីម៉ែត្រគូប?', '
The answer is : 70 km/h', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ៧០ គីឡូម៉ែត្រក្នុងមួយម៉ោង', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756976/RTL-Q060_mi5vuo.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792953/RTL-Q060-ENGLISH_vabbly.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793018/RTL-Q060-KHMER_olkaze.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:31.099643', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 15:11:57.455053', '2026-05-08 17:00:31.099643'),
  (606, 'RTL-Q059', 2, '  What is a maximum speed limit, km/h, in built-up area need to be limited for cars?', 'តើការកំណត់ល្បឿនបើកបរអតិបរមានៅក្នុងទីប្រជុំជន សម្រាប់រថយន្តប៉ុន្មានគីឡូម៉ែត្រក្នុងមួយម៉ោង ?', '
The answer is : 40 km/h', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ៤០ គីឡូម៉ែត្រក្នុងមួយម៉ោង', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756897/RTL-Q059_g74kzs.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792971/RTL-Q059-ENGLISH_oikohn.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793036/RTL-Q059-KHMER_ht6ffc.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:33.117949', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 15:09:55.2499', '2026-05-08 17:00:33.117949'),
  (615, 'RTL-Q068', 2, ' What shall drivers do when approach the bridge or railway crossing?', 'ពេលទៅជិតដល់ស្ពានឬជិតដល់ផ្លូវរថភ្លើងឆ្លងកាត់ តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្តេច ?', '
The answer is : Slow down.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : បន្ថយល្បឿន
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756968/RTL-Q068_pur9rp.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Speed Limits', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793004/RTL-Q068-ENGLISH_inei5n.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793017/RTL-Q068-KHMER_sk4csc.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:15.701403', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 15:24:33.294781', '2026-05-08 17:00:15.701403'),
  (624, 'RTL-Q077', 2, ' The definition of ’stopping’?', 'និយមន័យ «ឈប់» ?', '
The answer is : Not moving vehicle on the road for a short, while a driver is at the steering wheel or nearby the vehicle.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ការនៅស្ងៀមនៃយានជំនិះលើទ្រូងផ្លូវមួយរយៈពេលខ្លី ដែលមានអ្នកបើកបរ ស្ថិតនៅជាប់នឹងចង្កូតឬក្បែរយានជំនិះ
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756975/RTL-Q077_ribcxy.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792971/RTL-Q077-ENGLISH_gnwo9h.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793048/RTL-Q077-KHMER_frmnmn.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 16:59:55.569801', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:22:10.545958', '2026-05-08 16:59:55.569801'),
  (623, 'RTL-Q076', 2, '  The definition of a ’driver’?', 'និយមន័យ «អ្នកបើកបរ» ?', '
The answer is : The persons who operate the vehicles including an animal rider, an animal walker, and person who walk the animals on the road.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : អ្នកបញ្ជាយានជំនិះគិតទាំងអ្នកជិះសត្វ អ្នកដឹកសត្វ និងអ្នកបរសត្វ នៅលើផ្លូវ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756976/RTL-Q076_w5noy2.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792968/RTL-Q076-ENGLISH_fkpmdi.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793032/RTL-Q076-KHMER_pnc6y2.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 16:59:57.421253', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:20:22.249183', '2026-05-08 16:59:57.421253'),
  (622, 'RTL-Q075', 2, '  Can drivers stop on the railway?', 'លើផ្លូវរថភ្លើង តើអ្នកបើកបរអាចឈប់បានដែរឬទេ ?', '
The answer is : No, they cannot.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : មិនអាចឈប់បានទេ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756892/RTL-Q075_s6erwy.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792932/RTL-Q075-ENGLISH_eabmlq.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792980/RTL-Q075-KHMER_wskosk.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 16:59:59.375865', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:19:01.929327', '2026-05-08 16:59:59.375865'),
  (621, 'RTL-Q074', 2, '  In case the narrow roadway and cannot avoid each other between light-duty vehicle and heavy-duty vehicle, which one need to move backward?', 'ក្នុងករណីទ្រូងផ្លូវចង្អៀតមិនអាចជៀសគ្នាបានរវាងយានធុនស្រាល និងយានធុនធ្ងន់ តើយានណាមួយត្រូវថយក្រោយ ?', '
The answer is : The light-duty vehicle', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : យានធុនស្រាលត្រូវថយក្រោយ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756926/RTL-Q074_etsdlu.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793027/RTL-Q074-ENGLISH_edney6.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793032/RTL-Q074-KHMER_p7cxwi.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:02.017662', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:17:33.339203', '2026-05-08 17:00:02.017662'),
  (620, 'RTL-Q073', 2, '  A road with two opposite traffic directions, how shall drivers park or stop the vehicle?', 'ផ្លូវដែលមានទិសចរាចរណ៍ពីរផ្ទុយគ្នា តើអ្នកបើកបរយានជំនិះត្រូវឈប់ ឬចតយ៉ាងដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : Park or stop on the right, at its own traffic direction.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ត្រូវឈប់ ឬចតខាងស្ដាំដៃតាមទិសចរាចរណ៍របស់ខ្លួន', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756956/RTL-Q073_jz76rp.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792906/RTL-Q073-ENGLISH_k6dn16.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793026/RTL-Q073-KHMER_ziswzc.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:04.647999', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:16:11.479522', '2026-05-08 17:00:04.647999'),
  (619, 'RTL-Q072', 2, '  Can drivers park when seeing no stopping sign?', 'នៅពេលអ្នកបើកបរជួបផ្លាកសញ្ញាហាមឈប់ តើអាចចតបានឬទេ ?', '
The answer is : Cannot park', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : មិនអាចចតបានទេ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756954/RTL-Q072_kvebyj.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792945/RTL-Q072-ENGLISH_mhwxqu.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792963/RTL-Q072-KHMER_irdnpp.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:06.516111', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:14:39.822418', '2026-05-08 17:00:06.516111'),
  (618, 'RTL-Q071', 2, '  What are the most important safe factors of vehicle?', 'ចំណុចសំខាន់បំផុតសំរាប់សុវត្ថិភាពរបស់យានយន្តមានអ្វីខ្លះ ?', '
The answer is : Wheels, brakes, steering wheel, and lights', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : មានកង់ ហ្វ្រាំង ចង្កូត និងគ្រឿងបំភ្លឺ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756971/RTL-Q071_eczobb.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792965/RTL-Q071-ENGLISH_azkpxs.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793020/RTL-Q071-KHMER_aopy0v.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:10.022222', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:13:14.796687', '2026-05-08 17:00:10.022222'),
  (617, 'RTL-Q070', 2, ' In what case can drivers overtake on the right hand side?', 'តើក្នុងករណីណាដែលអ្នកបើកបរអាចជែងទៅខាងស្ដាំបាន ?', '
The answer is : The overtaking vehicle gave left sign and then stop or ready to turn left.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : យានដែលត្រូវជែងនោះ ឲ្យសញ្ញាប្ដូរទិសខាងឆ្វេង ហើយឈប់ ឬត្រៀមបត់ឆ្វេង
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756969/RTL-Q070_wxtmve.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792991/RTL-Q070-ENGLISH_gc3chh.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793030/RTL-Q070-KHMER_j5pmns.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 17:00:11.96693', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:11:47.740394', '2026-05-08 17:00:11.96693'),
  (633, 'RTL-Q086', 2, '  How shall you stop or park your vehicle on the road outside towns or densely populated areas?', 'នៅលើផ្លូវក្រៅទីប្រជុំជន តើយានជំនិះរបស់អ្នកត្រូវចត ឬឈប់យ៉ាងដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : Stop or park on the right roadside at its own traffic direction', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ត្រូវឈប់ ឬចតលើជាយផ្លូវខាងស្ដាំតាមទិសចរាចរណ៍', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756942/RTL-Q086_zphgbp.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793009/RTL-Q086-ENGLISH_n29s2x.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793043/RTL-Q086-KHMER_qg8ujf.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 16:59:36.72195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:38:06.730877', '2026-05-08 16:59:36.72195'),
  (632, 'RTL-Q085', 2, ' Can drivers overtake by three lines (overtake over another vehicle overtaking)?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរអាចជែងគ្នាជាបីជួរ(ជែងលើដែលកំពុងជែងគ្នា) បានដែរឬទេ ?', '
The answer is : Don’t overtake', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ហាមជែង
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756965/RTL-Q085_bwymrr.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792993/RTL-Q085-ENGLISH_dhwvfj.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792991/RTL-Q085-KHMER_cbwgml.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 16:59:38.44054', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:36:40.636215', '2026-05-08 16:59:38.44054'),
  (631, 'RTL-Q084', 2, ' At least how many meters away from another vehicle shall drivers leave when overtaking?', 'នៅពេលជែង តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវទុកចន្លោះពីយានមួយទៀតយ៉ាងតិចប៉ុន្មានម៉ែត្រ ?', '
The answer is : 1 m', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ១ ម៉ែត្រ
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756965/RTL-Q084_bjlffs.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792940/RTL-Q084-ENGLISH_hhiwq3.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793004/RTL-Q084-KHMER_eue9xu.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 16:59:40.09241', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 16:35:08.991912', '2026-05-08 16:59:40.09241'),
  (630, 'RTL-Q083', 2, ' Before overtaking the front vehicle, what shall drivers do?', 'មុននឹងជែងយានជំនិះនៅខាងមុខ តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវធ្វើអ្វីខ្លះ ?', '
The answer is : Knowing that the overtaking not cause any accident, and turn on the left turn light for overtaking.', '
