  (628, 'RTL-Q081', 2, '  The definition of ’large-sized passenger vehicle’?', 'និយមន័យ «រថយន្តដឹកជញ្ជូនអ្នកដំណើរធុនធំ» ?', '
The answer is : Vehicle accommodates more than 20 people, including the driver.', '
