  (635, 'RTL-Q088', 2, '  Along the road with double yellow lines, one is solid line and another is break line, dividing into two opposite traffic directions, which line that a driver closed to can cross or overtake?', 'តាមបណ្ដាយផ្លូវមានគំនូសសញ្ញាភ្លោះពណ៌លឿងមួយជាប់ និងមួយដាច់ៗសំរាប់បែងចែកជាពីរទិសចរាចរណ៍ផ្ទុយគ្នា តើអ្នកបើកបរ នៅកៀកគំនូសណាមួយអាចឆ្លងកាត់ ឬជែងបាន ?', '
The answer is : Driver who is closed to break line can cross or overtake.', '
