  (641, 'RTL-Q094', 2, ' Getting on the vehicle, before departure, what shall you do?', 'នៅពេលឡើងរថយន្ត មុននឹងចេញដំណើរ ត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : - Adjust the seat position and the winding mirrow, - Wear seat belt, check gear shift, start the engine to check the front and back light signs, engage the gear, - Release the front brake, and - Depart slowly.', '
