  (640, 'RTL-Q093', 2, ' The definition of ’Light-Duty Vehicle’?', 'និយមន័យ «រថយន្តធុនស្រាល» ?', '

The answer is : The vehicle with total maximum weight of not more than 3.5T.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ដែលមានទម្ងន់សរុបអតិបរមាមិនលើសពី ៣,៥ តោន', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756975/RTL-Q093_igvqc6.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792984/RTL-Q093-ENGLISH_qd0dkn.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793014/RTL-Q093-KHMER_dpqdw2.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:47:52.078379', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 17:35:41.086985', '2026-05-08 18:47:52.078379'),
  (639, 'RTL-Q092', 2, '  The definition of ’small-sized passenger vehicle’?', 'និយមន័យ «រថយន្តដឹកជញ្ជូនអ្នកដំណើរធុនតូច» ?', '
The answer is : Vehicle accommodates passengers ranging from 10 to 20, including the driver.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ផ្ទុកមនុស្សចាប់ពី ១០ ដល់ ២០នាក់ រួមទាំងអ្នកបើកបរ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756965/RTL-Q092_pwftb7.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792904/RTL-Q092-ENGLISH_vbqmzv.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793026/RTL-Q092-KHMER_b70rvn.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:47:54.577808', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 17:33:52.787816', '2026-05-08 18:47:54.577808'),
  (638, 'RTL-Q091', 2, 'When a vehicle with a total weight of more than 5T and broken, cannot be repaired, what material shall you use to hook and tow?', 'នៅពេលរថយន្ត ដែលមានទម្ងន់សរុបលើសពី៥តោនឡើងទៅ ខូចម៉ាស៊ីនពុំអាចជុសជុលបាន តើអ្នកត្រូវប្រើឧបករណ៍អ្វីដើម្បីថ្ពក់សណ្ដោង ?', '


The answer is : Use the long metal', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ត្រូវប្រើដងដែក', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756950/RTL-Q091_vtnix2.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793001/RTL-Q091-ENGLISH_tekpfw.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793038/RTL-Q091-KHMER_pgkz9u.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:47:57.27847', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 17:32:04.806849', '2026-05-08 18:47:57.27847'),
  (637, 'RTL-Q090', 2, ' How far from the intersection or the turn road shall you give a turn light sing?', 'មុនបត់ស្ដាំ ឬបត់ឆ្វេង តើអ្នកត្រូវអោយភ្លើងសញ្ញាប៉ុន្មានម៉ែត្រពីផ្លូវប្រសព្វ ឬកន្លែងដែលត្រូវបត់?', '
The answer is : At least 20 m', '
