', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756941/RTL-Q090_avxybj.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792961/RTL-Q090-ENGLISH_bjpwud.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1778259084/RTL-Q090_stbxn0.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:48:00.187941', NULL, '2026-05-08 16:59:19.595712', 'jjss', 0, '2026-05-08 16:46:21.758095', '2026-05-08 18:48:00.187941'),
  (651, 'RTL-Q107', 2, ' Can drive overtake on the bridge?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរអាចជែងគ្នានៅលើស្ពានបានដែរឬទេ ?', '

The answer is : Absolutely cannot', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : មិនអាចជែងបានជាដាច់ខាត', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756791/RTL-Q107_qi2j5w.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792939/RTL-Q107-ENGLISH_sxkvft.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793017/RTL-Q107-KHMER_zxiki1.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:47:27.115689', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 18:00:33.316408', '2026-05-08 18:47:27.115689'),
  (649, 'RTL-Q105', 2, ' The definition of ’sidewalks’?', 'និយមន័យ «ចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ» ?', '
The answer is : Both sides of the roadways for pedestrians, planting trees, and embedding equipment for public services.', '
