', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756989/RTL-Q105_gm7vzp.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793001/RTL-Q105-ENGLISH_la7zgd.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793066/RTL-Q105-KHMER_xewzhd.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:47:31.668222', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 17:57:26.437119', '2026-05-08 18:47:31.668222'),
  (647, 'RTL-Q103', 2, '  Getting to the intersection with sign ’STOP’, what shall drivers do?', 'ពេលដល់ផ្លូវប្រសព្វដែលមានដាក់ផ្លាកសញ្ញា“ឈប់”តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : Must stop even though there is traffic or not at the front.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ចាំបាច់ត្រូវតែឈប់ទោះបីផ្លូវខាងមុខមានឬគ្មានយានជំនិះធ្វើចរាចរណ៍ក៍ដោយ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756968/RTL-Q103_ephfl0.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792999/RTL-Q103-ENGLISH_tjmaqd.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793037/RTL-Q103-KHMER_ynbwbz.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:47:36.22633', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 17:54:04.425809', '2026-05-08 18:47:36.22633'),
  (646, 'RTL-Q102', 2, ' How far, on the roadway, from the curve markings shall drivers stop or park in the city or built-up area?', 'នៅក្នុងទីក្រុង ឬទីប្រជុំជន តើការឈប់ ឬចតរថយន្តនៅលើទ្រូងផ្លូវមានចំងាយប៉ុន្មាន ពីគែមចិញ្ចើមផ្លូវ ?', '

The answer is : Not more than 25cm', '
