ចម្លើយគឺ : ត្រូវមានអាយុចាប់ពី ១០ឆ្នាំ ពេញបរិបូរណ៍ឡើងទៅ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756990/RTL-Q124_wem1a1.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792971/RTL-Q124-ENGLISH_lbycwq.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792994/RTL-Q124-KHMER_uvdes1.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:46:42.428756', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 18:28:59.749592', '2026-05-08 18:46:42.428756'),
  (667, 'RTL-Q123', 2, ' In case a roadway is too narrow to allow two vehicles to pass, which vehicle shall reverse to give away?', 'ក្នុងករណីទ្រូងផ្លូវចង្អៀត មិនអាចជៀសគ្នាបាន តើយានជំនិះណាមួយត្រូវថយក្រោយ', '
The answer is : Cargo truck', '
