', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756957/RTL-Q123_msknmv.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792907/RTL-Q123-ENGLISH_uwtaj1.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793041/RTL-Q123-KHMER_n1cplp.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:46:44.54039', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 18:26:24.944877', '2026-05-08 18:46:44.54039'),
  (659, 'RTL-Q115', 2, ' What shall you do when there is a running car behind get to overtake you?', 'បើមានរថយន្តនៅពីក្រោយសុំជែង តើអ្នកត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : If available, give the right turn sign, slow down, and a bit move to the right side as a sign to let it overtakes.', '
