  (650, 'RTL-Q106', 2, '  What shape is a danger sign?', 'ផ្លាកសញ្ញាគ្រោះថ្នាក់មានទ្រង់ទ្រាយដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : Square shap with one vertical diagonal, bouble layers edge, thick black layer, thin white outer edge, yellow inner background and black sign or picture.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : រាងជាការ៉េមានអង្កត់ទ្រូងមួយជាខ្សែឈរមានជាយពីរជាន់ ជាយពណ៍ខ្មៅក្រាស់និងជាយក្រៅពណ៍សស្តើងផ្ទៃក្នុងពណ៍លឿងរូបឬសញ្ញាពណ៍ខ្មៅ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756899/RTL-Q106_ciahkl.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793031/RTL-Q106-ENGLISH_boubc2.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793067/RTL-Q106-KHMER_himt2a.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-08 18:47:29.5184', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-08 17:58:58.520437', '2026-05-08 18:47:29.5184'),
  (648, 'RTL-Q104', 2, '  Hearing the siren of a vehicle with priority, what shall you do?', 'ពេលឮស៊ីរ៉ែនរថយន្តដែលមានសិទ្ធិអាទិភាព តើអ្នកត្រូវធ្ធើដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : Give a right​ sign, slow down or stop at the right side, to prioritize siren vehicle goes ahead.', '
