  (681, 'RTL-Q137', 2, '  When and where can drivers honk the horn?', 'តើអ្នកបើកបរអាចប្រើសូរស័ព្ទ ស៊ីផ្លេ នៅពេលណា? កន្លែងណា?', '
The answer is : At day time, when overtake, not to honk near the hospital or anywhere with no-horn sign.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ពេលថ្ងៃ ពេលសុំជែង និងមិនត្រូវប្រើនៅជិតមន្ទីពេទ្យឬកន្លែងណាមានសញ្ញាហាមស៊ីផ្លេ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756955/RTL-Q137_dkh3iq.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793015/RTL-Q137-ENGLISH_kcxjaf.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793061/RTL-Q137-KHMER_xzkgfq.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-09 06:06:55.135589', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-09 05:51:14.350494', '2026-05-09 06:06:55.135589'),
  (680, 'RTL-Q136', 2, ' Outside built-up area, how far, at least, from the intersection, or turn road, or bend road, shall you stop or park your vehicle?', 'នៅក្រៅទីប្រជុំជន តើអ្នកបើកបរត្រូវឈប់ ឬចតយានជំនិះ យ៉ាងតិចប៉ុន្មានម៉ែត្រ ពីផ្លូវប្រសព្វ ឬផ្លូវបត់ ឬផ្លូវកោង ?', '

The answer is : 10m', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ចម្ងាយ ១០ ម៉ែត្រ', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756951/RTL-Q136_dmkibz.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Parking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792923/RTL-Q136-ENGLISH_qevvkv.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793047/RTL-Q136-KHMER_xnvhbt.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-09 06:06:57.599664', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-09 05:49:56.49022', '2026-05-09 06:06:57.599664'),
  (674, 'RTL-Q130', 2, ' What shape is a mandatory sign?', 'ផ្លាកសញ្ញាបញ្ជាមានទ្រង់ទ្រាយដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : Circle with whit edge surrounded, the inside surface is blue. There is a white sign or a note in the zone.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ផ្លាកសញ្ញាបញ្ជារាងមូល ជាយពណ៌សព័ទ្ធជុំវិញផ្ទៃក្នុងពណ៌ខៀវ និងមានរូប ឬសញ្ញាសំគាល់ខាងក្នុងពណ៌ស
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756885/RTL-Q130_vdxee1.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792967/RTL-Q130-ENGLISH_rqarmr.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793052/RTL-Q130-KHMER_jhqpbz.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-09 06:06:27.362734', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-09 05:41:41.364869', '2026-05-09 06:06:27.362734'),
  (684, 'RTL-Q140', 2, ' After overtaking, how shall you pay attention?', 'នៅពេលជែងរួច តើអ្នកត្រូវប្រុងប្រយ័ត្នអ្វីខ្លះ ?', '
The answer is : After overtaking, you shall give changing direction sign to the right to alert that you move to current traffic with care.', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ពេលជែងរួចត្រូវធ្វើសញ្ញាប្ដូរទិសទៅស្ដាំ ដើម្បីឲ្យដំណឹងថាត្រូវចូលក្នុងចរន្ដចរាចរណ៍ដើមវិញដោយប្រយ័ត្ន
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756778/RTL-Q140_xiopbh.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Overtaking', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793000/RTL-Q140-ENGLISH_ssobie.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793067/RTL-Q140-KHMER_isgusf.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-09 06:06:47.386862', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-09 05:55:49.505058', '2026-05-09 06:06:47.386862'),
  (676, 'RTL-Q132', 2, ' When your vehicle hit a person or others having traffic on the road, what shall you do?', 'នៅពេលរថយន្តអ្នកបុកមនុស្ស ឬប៉ះនឹងអ្នកធ្វើចរាចរណ៍លើផ្លូវសាធារណៈ តើអ្នកត្រូវធ្វើដូចម្ដេច ?', '
The answer is : Get off the vehicle and recure and inform to the nearby traffic police', '
ចម្លើយគឺ : ឈប់យាន ចុះជួយសង្គ្រោះ និងផ្ដល់ដំណឹងដល់ភ្នាក់ងារនគរបាលចរាចរណ៍ដែលនៅជិតបំផុត
', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1777756985/RTL-Q132_u8kfnb.jpg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Traffic Rules', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777792987/RTL-Q132-ENGLISH_ng71em.wav', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777793055/RTL-Q132-KHMER_zyeete.wav', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-09 06:07:07.332225', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-09 05:44:12.058315', '2026-05-09 06:07:07.332225'),
  (227, 'PW03-M1-03', 1, 'GIVE WAY LINE ( DOUBLE BROKEN ).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាផ្តល់សិទ្ធិអាទិភាព ( ភ្លោះ )', 'Double broken white lines across the road used to define the position where drivers must stop in front of the lines at intersections with ''GIVE WAY'' signs and no traffic lights.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាភ្លោះ ដាច់ៗពណ៌ស កាត់ទទឹងទ្រូងផ្លូវ ប្រើ សម្រាប់ កំណត់ទីតាំងអោយអ្នកបើកបរឈប់ នៅត្រឹម មុខគំនូសនេះ នៅត្រង់ផ្លូវប្រសព្វ ដែលមានផ្លាកសញ្ញា ផ្តល់សិទ្ធិ អាទិភាពអោយគេ និង គ្មានភ្លើងសញ្ញា ចរាចរ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173046/PW03-M1-03KWD_lfcb5q.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Transverse Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276253/PW03-M1-03_ghbrrf.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276541/PW03-M1-03_adkgde.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-05-09 10:16:10.952734', NULL, '2026-05-09 09:45:59.872814', 'hhh', 0, '2026-04-29 11:56:56.78728', '2026-05-09 10:16:10.952734'),
  (226, 'PW03-M1-02', 1, 'STOP LINE ( DOUBLE SOLID ).', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាឈប់ ( ភ្លោះ )', 'Double solid white lines across the road used to define the position where drivers must stop in front of the lines at intersections with ''STOP'' signs to give priority and where there are no traffic lights.', 'គំនូសសញ្ញាភ្លោះ ជាប់ពណ៌ស កាត់ទទឹងទ្រូងផ្លូវ ប្រើ សម្រាប់ កំណត់ទីតាំងអោយអ្នកបើកបរឈប់ នៅត្រឹមមុខ គំនូសនេះ នៅត្រង់ផ្លូវប្រសព្វ ដែលមានផ្លាកសញ្ញា ឈប់ ដើម្បី ផ្តល់សិទ្ធិអាទិភាពអោយគេ និង គ្មាន ភ្លើងសញ្ញាចរាចរ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173046/PW03-M1-02KWD_mgevnf.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Transverse Markings', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276252/PW03-M1-02_tvxwo1.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276540/PW03-M1-02_p2evfm.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 5, 1, '2026-05-09 10:16:09.221804', NULL, NULL, 'Admin requested revision — please update and resubmit.', 0, '2026-04-29 11:55:37.639992', '2026-05-09 10:16:09.221804'),
  (689, 'PW03-G2-01', 1, ' BUILD UP AREA.', 'ចូលទីប្រជុំជន', '
