  (720, 'PW03-R1-31', 1, ' NO HORN.', 'ហាមស៊ីផ្លេ', '
This sign prohibits all types of vehicles from using their horn, except in cases of immediate danger.', '
សញ្ញានេះ៖ ហាមស៊ីផ្លេ ចំពោះយានជំនិះគ្រប់ប្រភេទ លើកលែងតែករណីមានគ្រោះថ្នាក់បន្ទាន់ ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173164/PW03-R1-31KWD_mjyetc.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276312/PW03-R1-31_mgw37k.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276487/PW03-R1-30_tumxz4.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-11 10:01:49.714536', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-11 09:38:21.965611', '2026-05-11 10:01:49.714536'),
  (719, 'PW03-R1-30', 1, ' END OF NO OVERTAKE FOR SIMILAR LARGE-SIZE TRUCK.', 'ចប់ការហាមជែង ចំពោះរថយន្តដឹកទំនិញធុនធំ ដូចគ្នា', '
This sign indicates the end of the overtaking prohibition for similar-sized large trucks.
', '
សញ្ញានេះ៖ ចប់ការហាមជែង ចំពោះរថយន្តដឹកទំនិញធុនធំដែលមានទំហំប្រហាក់ប្រហែលគ្នា ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173164/PW03-R1-30KWD_vlnn7m.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276312/PW03-R1-30_oihzo2.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276487/PW03-R1-29_ezt4te.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-11 10:01:51.425559', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-11 09:36:47.34588', '2026-05-11 10:01:51.425559'),
  (718, 'PW03-R1-29', 1, ' NO OVERTAKE FOR SIMILAR LARGE-SIZE TRUCK.', 'ហាមប្រជែង ចំពោះរថយន្តដឹកទំនិញធុនធំ ប្រហាក់ប្រហែលគ្នា', '
This sign prohibits large-sized trucks of similar size from overtaking each other.
', '
សញ្ញានេះ៖ ហាមជែង ចំពោះរថយន្តដឹកទំនិញធុនធំដែលមានទំហំប្រហាក់ប្រហែលគ្នា ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173165/PW03-R1-29KWD_fqa5r0.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276311/PW03-R1-29_r35nxv.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276486/PW03-R1-28_rm5jye.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-11 10:01:53.213661', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-11 09:34:29.343048', '2026-05-11 10:01:53.213661'),
  (730, 'PW03-R1-41', 1, ' MAXIMUM SPEED LIMIT.', 'កំណត់ល្បឿនអតិបរមា', '
This sign prohibits all types of motor vehicles from driving over the speed limit (in kilometers per hour) as specified on the sign.
', '
សញ្ញានេះ ៖ ហាមយានយន្តគ្រប់ប្រភេទ បើកបរលើសល្បឿន (គិតជាគីឡូម៉ែត្រក្នុង១ម៉ោង) ដូចមានកំណត់ក្នុងផ្ទាំងសញ្ញា ។', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/image/upload/v1775173159/PW03-R1-41KWD_bhxu0a.svg', 'cloudinary', NULL, 'Prohibitory Signs', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276321/PW03-R1-41_f8belk.mp3', 'cloudinary', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgivqzrl/video/upload/v1777276495/PW03-R1-40_qwfrur.ogg', 'cloudinary', 'published', 2, 1, '2026-05-11 10:01:29.332356', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-05-11 09:54:29.624555', '2026-05-11 10:01:29.332356'),
  (729, 'PW03-R1-40', 1, ' NO ENTRY FOR VEHICLE LOADING INFLAMMABLE OR EXPLOSABLE GOODS.', 'ហាមចូលចំពោះយានយន្តដឹកផលិតផលផ្ទុះ ឬងាយឆេះ', '
